\id 1SA  
\toc1 Samuel Khatna 
\toc2 1 Samuel 
\toc3 1 Samuel 
\mt1 SAMUEL  
\mt2 LEKHABU KHATNA  
\mt3 Samuel Lekhabu Khatna Sung Thu Umdan  
\ip Samuel lekhabu tenia hin, tukhang idinmun utoh kitoh in thil phabep aum'in ahi. Hatsahna le lungsatna ato hou na simdoh akon nangman jong thil tampi na lamdoh thei ding—chule hinkhoa hin Pathen beijin ima ahi theipoi, ti nahetdoh ding ahi. Chujongleh Pakai, Pathen hi amite chunga akitah jinge, ti Samuel lekhabu khatna hin aphong doh e.  
\ip Hiche lekhabu nasim akon a hi Israel te chunga vaihom lamkai chu Pathen mi ham ahilouleh Pathen mi hilou ham, ti na hetdoh ding ahi. Hiche lekhabua hin Saul lengpa le David lamkai ahina lhon akibah louna aum'e, ti kicheh tah in aseijin ahi. Hinlah ani lhon’a Pathen thaonu chang ahi lhon'in chule thil tampi jong atongdoh lhon'in ahi. Chujongleh ani lhon'in alosam kit lhon'in, chonset achun alhalut lhon tai. Hiche lamkai teni kah a akikhehna lhon hi ipi pen ham? Saul chun achonset aselmang kigon, David chun kisih a lunghei ding, atin ahi.  
\ip Koima achamkim aumpon, ibonchauvin ilhasam sohkeiyun, ahin hiche lhahsamna chu hinkhoa thusim achaina ahipoi. David banga lungput dalha a Pathen henga kile kit ding phajo ham, ahilouleh Saul banga mihem maivea chonset phondoh louding phajo ham? Hiche teni lah a hi hoiche pen nalhen ding ham? Hiche ivetkah teni uva kon a hi hoiche nalhen’a chule hoiche pen na peldoh ding ham?  
\is1 Lekhabu Jihpa Chule Akijih Kum  
\ip Koipen in ajih ham ti akimin phah pon ahi. Hinlah Samuel themgao, Nathan le Gad in hiche thucheng jouse hi ana khol khom uva (1Chro. 29:29), hichu Samuel Khatna le Samuel Nina a kigom khom ahi.  
\ip Hiche lekhabu hi 925 BC vel’a kijih hidin ginchat ahin, chule sahlam le lhanglam kihop khen jou 930 BC vel’a ana kijih ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Elkanah Le A Insung Mite  
\p
\v 1 Masang laiyin Elkanah kiti mikhat Ramah kho thinglhang gam molsang Ramathiam Zophim mun’ah anachengin ahi. Ama chu Jeroham chapa, Elihu chapa, Tohu chapa, Zuph chapa, Ephriam mi ahi.  
\v 2 Elkanah in ji ni aneijin, Hannah le Peninnah ahi. Peninnah in cha aneijin, ahin Hannah vang'in aneipoi.   
\p
\v 3 Elkanah hi kumseh leh Shiloh a Pakai van gam sepai te henga gan kilhaina maicham semdin acheyin ahi.Hiche lai chun Eli Pakai thempu pan chapa ni aneijin ahi, amani min chu Hopni le Phinehe ahi lhon'e.  
\v 4 Elkanah hin gan kilhaina abolni tengleh achan dingdol sachan chu Peninnah le achate apeyin ahi.  
\v 5 Chule Hannah angailut jeh chun, Pakaijin anaobu akhapeh jeh chun, sachan chan khat bou apeyin ahi.  
\v 6 Chumale Pakaijin Hannah chu anaobu akhapeh jeh chun, Peninnah in jong Hannah chu noise tah in alunghan han nadin totnopnan abolyin ahi.  
\v 7 Kumlhun seh leh abang bang ahiyingin-Hannah Pakai hou dinga Hou-In'a achetengleh Peninnah kitinu hin phin lunghang jin , hijeh chun amanu akapin anjong aneji tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 8 “Ipi jeh a naka ham, Hannah?” Elkanah in adongin, “Ibola an nelouva umah nahim? Chule ibola lungkhama um nahim? Kei neinei hime-chapa somkhat neiho sanga kaphatchom joh louham? ati.   
\s1 Hannah Chapa Dia Ataona  
\p
\v 9 ama hon Shiloh’a gan kilhaina anneh, twidon achaiphat’un, Hannah akipatdoh in taodingin achetai. Eli thempu chu Pakai Hou-In khombul khatna touna chunga touva ahi.  
\v 10 Hannah vang chu lhase beh seh jengin, Pakai henga ataovin, lhasetah in akapjah in ahi.  
\v 11 Chule amanun kitepna khat aneijin, “O Van gam Sepai te Pakai, gentheiya ka kana neihin velhin lang kataona neihin ngailhah peh inlang ‘chapa khat neipetan,’” ati. \x + \xo 1:11 \xt Minbu 6:5\x*   
\p
\v 12 Amanu Pakai henga ataopet’in Eli thempun ane phunchu ana mulhin ahi.  
\v 13 Anephu achaloh chu amun, ahinlah ataogin aw chu ajapoi, ageldan in amanu hin ju adonkham hinte ati ahi.  
\v 14 Aman Hannah jah a “Hilai munna hi jukham puma nahung ham? Najukham chu paidoh loijin,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 “Kahipoi, kapu!” tin adonbut’e, “Keiman ju kadonpoi, chule khamnathei ho jong kadonpoi, ahinlah kei hi numei genthei chungnung kahi, Pakai agsunga hi kahinna pumpia thuseijoh kahi bouve,” ati.  
\v 16 “Keima numei phalouvin neigel hihbeh in! Ahinlah lung genthei puma taojing jengjoh kahi bouve,” ati.   
\p
\v 17 Hiche chung thu ahin Elin hitin ana seipeh in ahi, “Lungmongin chetan, Israel Pathen'in nathilthum jouse chu nasan peh intin phatthei naboh hen.”   
\p
\v 18 Hannah in jong, “Oh hepu kakipah e!” atin, akinunglen an anepantai, alungkham tapon ahi.   
\s1 Samuel Ahungpen Le Akilhandohna  
\p
\v 19 Ajingkah khovah matah in a insung pumpi athouvun, Pakai houkit dingin ache tauve. Chujou’in ain’u Ramah ah ahung kile kit tauvin ahi.  
\v 20 Chule Hannah chun aphat chan, naosen pasal khat aneitai. Amanun jong amin Samuel asahtai, ajeh chu “Ama ding’a hi Pakai kom'a kathum ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Akum kit in Elkanah le a insung mite jouse kum kichaiya gan kilhaina-a Pakai hou dingin akitol kit tauve.  
\v 22 Ahinlah Hannah chu anache tapon ahi. Ainneipu kom'ah hitin aseijin, “Naosen aletdom kahsen ngah hitin kumkit tengleh keiman hinpui ingting, imatih chana dingin Pakai toh umden tante,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Nasei chu aphaselle tin Elkanah in pha asatai. “Tutadin hichea hin uminlang, Pakaijin nakitepna banginnapanpi hen.” Hijeh chun amanu inah aumin, naosen aletdom kahsen aumpin ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Chuin naosen ahunglet domphat in, Hannah in Shiloh a pon-in ah ahinpuiyin ahi. Ama hon bongchal kumthum lhingsa khat toh ahinpui thauvin, changbong neldisel Ephah dimkhat toh apon lengpitwi peng thei khat dimset toh akidop’in naosen chapang chu Shiloh khoa Pakai houna in ah ahin puilut tai, naosen chu chapang chabou ahi nalaiye.  
\v 25 Bongchal atha jou phat’un ama hon naosen chu Eli thempu kom ahin puilut tauve.  
\v 26 “Kapuu, neigeldoh em?” tin Hannah in adongin ahi. “Keima kum tampi hilai mun'a Pakai henga anatao jing numei nu chu kahi,” ati.  
\v 27 “Pakai kom'a hiche chapa hi eipeh dia ana taojing kahin, Pakaijin kataona eidonbut pen tan ahi,” ati.  
\v 28 “Tun keiman ama hi Pakai henga kahin pehdoh ahitai. Ahinkho lhumkeiya dinga kapehdoh ahitai. Hichun ama hon hikom'a chun Pakai chibai aboh tauve.   
\c 2  
\s1 Hannah Thangvah Taona  
\p
\v 1 Chuin hiti hin Hannah ataovin:  
\b  
\q1 “Ka lungsung Pakaiyah akipah jinge!  
\q2 Pakaijin eihatsah tai. \x + \xo 2:1 \xt Lk 1:46-55\x*  
\q1 Tun kamelma te donbutna ding kanei tai;  
\q2 Kakipah e ajeh chu nangman nei lhatdoh tai.   
\q1
\v 2 Pakai tobanga theng adang aumpoi!  
\q2 Nangma tobang koima dang aumpoi,  
\q2 Eiho Pathen tobang songpi dang aumpoi.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 3 “Kiletsah tah in hoithona thu seidan!  
\q2 Huham tah in paodoh hih hellin!  
\q1 Ajeh chu Pakai hi Pathen ahin ipi nabol ahetlou imacha aumpoi;  
\q2 natoh ho jouse thu atan ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 4 Gal-hat te thalpi jouse tunvang akiheh bongtan,  
\q2 mi thalhom chu thahat akisotai.   
\q1
\v 5 Oivasetna neten neh ding nei louvin kel thoh in aum’un,  
\q2 agilkel ho avasoh tauve.  
\q1 Chaneilou nu chun tun cha sagi aneitan,  
\q2 chule cha tamtah neinu chun amansah gamtai.   
\q1
\v 6 Pakaijin thina le hinna ani gellin apen;  
\q2 aman abang lhankhuh ah alhahsuh sah in hinlah abang akai thouve.   
\q1
\v 7 Pakaijin abang avaichat sah in adang ahao sah e;  
\q2 abang alhahsuh sah in abang aphong dingin ahi.   
\q1
\v 8 Aman vaicha ho leivuija kon'in aphong sangin  
\q2 chule angaicha te nen khuh a konin achoisang'e.  
\q1 Leng chapa te lah a tousah in,  
\q2 loupina laltouna a atousah e.  
\q1 Thilsem jouse hi Pakaiya ahin,  
\q2 chule vannoija thil ho jouse kitoh tah in akoiye.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 9 “Aman ama dinga tahsan umtah ho chu aventup ding ahi,  
\q2 ahinlah michonse ho chu muthim lah a mangthah ding ahiuve.  
\q1 Ajeh chu athahatna a koimacha dingjou louding ahi.   
\q2
\v 10 Pakai douna a galsat ho chu cheh chao ding ahiuve.  
\q1 Amaho douna a van'a konna keh alhah sah ding ahi;  
\q2 Pakaijin van'a kon'in leiset a thu ahin tanin ahi.  
\q1 Aman aleng ho chu thahatna apen;  
\q2 aman athaonu changho chung'ah athanei nau abelap peh in ahi.”   
\b  
\p
\v 11 Chujouvin Samuel jaolouvin Elkanah jong a in lam Ramah kho ah akiletan ahi. Chule chapang pan thempu Eli kithopi nan Pakai kin abolin ahi.   
\s1 Eli Thempu Chapa Phalou Teni  
\p
\v 12 Eli chapa teni chu migilou michavai ahilhon toh kilhon’in Pakai ginna le jana pelou ahi lhon'e.  
\v 13 Hiche laiya thempu hija atoh dingdol mi koi tobang hamkhat in kilhaina atodoh teng, Eli chapa teni chun sohpa chu satul kathum nei khat puma asolji lhonin ahi. Hichu gancha thilto sa kihonsou lai pet ahiji.  
\v 14 Hiche thihkhe chu khangbel sunga asolutna, asodoh pen-pen chu Eli chate apeh ding, Israel chate Shiloh a gan kilhaina a hunglha jouse hitia chu gihna aneiji lhon ahi.  
\v 15 Abang kom le sathao ho kilhutvam masang le thempupa sohpa chu hunga kilhaina ganthatpa jah a chu hitin ahung seiji'n, “Thempupa kigo ding sahing neipen, ajeh chu aman nangma honminsa chu akilah louhel ding ahi, sahing bou adei ahiye,” tia ahung sei ding ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Mihem gan kilhaina kin sempa chun hitin adonbut jin ahi, “Nadei jat-jat kilah in, ahinlah athao kihallha masa ding ahi,” atijin, ahin thempu sohpan jong, “Ahipoi nangman atuma neipeh doh ding ahi, achuti louva ahileh keiman pumhatna kalahpeh ding nahi,” tin aseijin ahi.  
\v 17 Hiti chun hiche khangthah teni chonsetna chu akhoh lheh jeng tan, ajeh chu Pakai maicham jeng jong chu kimit thipna changin anei tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Ahinlah Samuel chu chapang cha hijongleh, Pakai lhachan apangtai. Thempu kivonna tupat ponnem khat in akong akigah jin Pakai angsung'ah lhachan apangji tan ahi.  
\v 19 Kumseh leh anun sangkhol chol neo khat akhuipeh in a inneipu toh kilhaina gantha bol dingin achekhom lhon'in ahi.  
\v 20 Inlama ahung kile masang teng’u leh, Eli in Elkanah le a inneipi phatthei abohjin chule hitin aseiji’e, “Pakaijin hiche na inneipi chapa khat napeh jeh in amanu a kon'in cha le nao tampi nahinsah hen,” tin aseiye.  
\v 21 Chule Pakaijin chapa thum le chanu ni apen, hiti chun Samuel chu Pakai angsung’a ahung khangtou touvin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Tun Eli chu ateh lheh jeng tan, chujongleh achapa tenin Israel mi tampi abolna lhon thu kithang, kikhopna ponbuh kotpi phunga lhacha a pang numeiho aluppi lhon jong ajatai.  
\v 23 Hijeh chun Eli in ajah lhon'ah, “Na thilbol lhon jouse Israel mipi ten kakom'a aseiyun kaja sohkei tai, ipi bolla hitobang chonsetna hi nabol lhon ham?  
\v 24 Na ngah tei-tei lhon ding ahi, kacha teni! Pakai mitea konna kajah thucheng ho hi ahoi hihbeh jengin ahi.  
\v 25 Mihem khat chu mihem dang khat douna a achonsetna ahileh Pathen'in asuhcham thei ahi, amavang mihem khat chu Pakai douna a achonsetna ahileh, koipen in ama dinga asei champeh ding hitam?” ati. Ahinlah Eli chapa tenin apa thusei ngai nahsah in anei lhon poi. Hijeh chun Pakaijin amani thina ding gonsan akoitai.   
\p
\v 26 Chapang cha hijongleh, Samuel vang chu Pakai le mihem te deisah in akhangtou touvin ahi. \x + \xo 2:26 \xt Lk 2:52\x*   
\s1 Eli Thempu Insung Gihna  
\m
\v 27 Nikhat hi Pathen mi khat Eli kom'a ahungin, ahin ama chu Pakaiya kon'in thu ahinpo in, hitin aseipeh tai: “Keima, Egypt gamsung Pharaoh insunga soh changa aumlai uva napa insung mite henga kei le kei kiphong doh a kahitai.  
\v 28 Keiman Aaron hi Israel phung jousea konna ka thempu hi ding chule ka maicham chunga thilto ding, gimnamtui hal ding chule ka masanga thempu sangkhol chol kivon’a, kakin tong ding’a ka lhendoh nahi hilou ham? Chule Israel chate a konna kimudoh kei dinga thilto jouse chu napa insung mite ka pehdohsa ahitai. \x + \xo 2:28 \xt Potdohbu 28:1-4; \xt Thempu Dan 7:35,36\x*   
\p
\v 29 Achutia ahileh ipi dinga kaumna a ka thupeh gan kilhaina le kathilto napai manga, kami Israel te thilpeh jousea konna ahoipen chun na thaodoh sahna dinga kei sanga na chapa teni na jabol joh ham? Kami Israel te thilto aphalai laiya chu nangho kivah thao chet nahiu hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 30 “Hijeh chun Pakai Israel Pathen'in hitin aseiye, keiman nangma Levi insung le napa insung chu imatih chan a ka thempu a pang diu ahi tia naseisa ahin, ahinlah keima eija a chu keiman jong ama chu kaja ding ahi, chule keima giltah a eibol louva chu keiman jong ka khohsah louding ahi.  
\v 31 Phat ahung lhunge, vetan, Keiman na thaneina ka suhbeina ding nikho ahung nai tul-tul'e. Hiteng chule na insunga pasal tehse khat chabeh jong hung umlou ding ahiye.  
\v 32 Hiche phatteng chule Israel te kipe haona chu nangman ngaicha geova na mitlhi lha-lha a nahin vet ding ahi. Chujongleh na insunga konna pasal ateh a thi khat a khatcha jong umdoh louding ahitai.  
\v 33 Ahingdoh chasun jong gim hesoh thoh a um diu, chule achate hou jong thise jenga thi diu ahi.  
\v 34 Ka thusei ho hung guilhung ding vetsahna chu, nacha teni chunga hunglhung ding, Hophni chule Phinehas, nikhat sunga ani lhon’a thi ding ahi! \x + \xo 2:34 \xt 1 Samuel 4:11\x*   
\p
\v 35 “Chutengleh keiman tahsan umtah thempu eijen ding leh kalung deitah bolding ka tundoh ding ahi. A insung jeng jong ka tundoh peh a, chule amaho chu ka leng tundoh ho thempu a tonsot a pang dingu ahi.  
\v 36 Chuteng na insung’a ahing chengse a angsunga bohkhup uva, paisa le an athum diu, 'Lungset tah in' tia asei diu, 'natoh ding nei peuvin, thempuho lah ah, chuteng keihon neh ding kham nei tauvinge, ati diu ahi,'” ati.   
\c 3  
\s1 Samuel Pakaijin Akou  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun, Chapangpa Samuel chun Eli thempu noiya lhacha na atong jingin ahi. Chuche nikholai chun Pakaiya konna thu hung kiphong chu ahah lheh jeng tai, chule themgao mu nei a jong aum vah-vah tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Eli thempu in kho amuthei beh talou ahin, jankhat hi alupna ajon tan ahi.  
\v 3 Pathen thaomei kide jong chu kisumit loulai ahin, Samuel vang chu ponbuh sunga a imutan ahi. Alupna chu Pathen Thingkhong komtah ahi.  
\v 4 Photlot louvin Pakaijin, “Samuel” tin ahin koutan ahile,  
\p “Hoiyo, Ipi thu hitam?” tin ana donbut in ahi.  
\v 5 Ama athoudoh in Eli komlang ah alhaiyin, “Hiche ah kaum'e nei kouvem?” aga tin ahile,  
\p Eli thempu jong, “Kakoupoi, nalupna ah chekit tan,” tin adonbut in ahile ama jong achekit tai.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun Pakaijin Samuel chu, “Samuel” tin ahin kou kittai.  
\p Samuel jong athoudoh kit in Eli kom'a achekit in, “Hiche ah kaum'e nei kouvem?” agatin ahi. Eli in jong hitin asei kit in,  
\p “Chapa ka koupoi, nalupna a che kittan,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Samuel in Pakai ahi ding chu ahetlou ahi ajeh chu hitobang Pakai kouna chu ana jah khah loulai ahi.  
\v 8 Chuin Pakaijin thumvei channan ahinkou kit in, Samuel athou doh in Eli thempu chu aga dong kit in, “Hiche ah kaum'e. Nei kouvem?” ati.  
\p Chuin Eli in Pakai kouna ahi ding kichen tah in ahetai.  
\v 9 Chuin Samuel jah ah hitin aseipeh in, “Galum kit inlang, ijem tia nahung kikou kit a ahileh, ‘Pakai seijin na lhachapa keiman kangaiye’” tin aseipeh tai, hichun Samuel jong ajalkhun lam'ah akile kittai.   
\p
\v 10 Chule Samuel henga Pakai ahungin, “Samuel! Samuel!” tin akouvin ahile, Samuel in, “Seijin na lhacha pa keiman kangaiye,” tin adonbut tan ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin Pakaijin Samuel kom'a, “Ven keiman Israel sunga thil khat kabol ding ahin hichun aja jouse nakhang asut ding ahi.  
\v 12 Hiche nikho chule Eli insung douna a kasei jouse chu abul akipat a achaina geiya ka guilhun sah sohkei ding ahi.  
\v 13 Keiman thutanna hi ama le a insung mite chunga thu katan ding ahi, ti thu kapeh ahitai, hichu a imatih chan a ding ahi, ajeh chu acha tenin Pathen ataitom lhon'in, chule aman jong gihsalna aneipon ahi.  
\v 14 Hijeh chun keiman Eli le acha teni chonsetna chu ka ngaidam louding, kilhaina le pumgo thilto ho a kisucham joulou ding ahitai,” ati.   
\s1 Samuel In Pakaiya Dinga Thu Asei  
\p
\v 15 Samuel alupna ah jingkah chan geiyin aumden tai, chuin Ponbuh sunga kon'in ahung thoudoh in kot ahin hongdoh in ahi. Athujah ho Eli jah a Pakai thusei doh ding chu akicha behseh jengin ahi.  
\v 16 Ahinlah Eli in akouvin, “Kacha Samuel,” tia agah kouleh,  
\p “Kei hicheah kaumnai,” tin Samuel in adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 17 “Pakaijin nakom'a ipi asei em? Abonchan imchah umlouvin nei seipeh in, ijem tia na im'a na seidoh louva ahile Pathen mi jepna le Pathen a konna thina na chunga chumai tahen,” ati.  
\v 18 Chuin Samuel in Eli kom'a abonchan aseipeh sohkei tai, imacha aseidoh lou aum tapoi. Hichun Eli thempun jong, “Hiche hi Pathen phatsah ahi,” tin aphongdoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Samuel ahung khandoh toh lhon'in Pakaijin aumpin ahi. Chule thil ijakai Samuel in asei jouse aguilhung sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 20 Chule Israel mipite jouse, Dan a kipat chunglam Beersheba chen geijin ahen, Samuel Pathen themgao ahitai ti suhdet ahitai.  
\v 21 Pakai jong Shiloh mun'ah akilah jing jengin, Ponbuh sungah Samuel themgao kom'ah thu alhut in ahi.   
\c 4  
\nb
\v 1 Chule Samuel in Israel mipi te lah a ale lhut kitjin ahi.  
\s1 Philistine Ten Pathen Thingkhong Alahpeh  
\m Hiche phat laiya chu Israel te le Philistine mite kikah a kigalna uma ahi. Israel sepai ho Ebenezer kom'a ngahmun uma ahi, chule Philistine ten Aphek mun a ngahmun aneiyu ahi.  
\v 2 Philistine ten Israel mite gallin ahin nokhum'un ahile Israel sepai ten ana lal’un mi 4,000 jen ana that tauve.  
\v 3 Chuin gal kisat akichaiya mipite angahmun ahung lhunphat un, Israel upaho chun, “Ipi jeh a tunia Pakaijin Philistine masanga gal eilalsah u hintem?” Chuin ama hon aseiyun, “Shiloh a kon'in Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu eiho dingin gapudoh uhitin hichu ilah uva ahung lhun tengleh, hichun igalteuva kon'in eihuhdoh thei tauvinte,” akitiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hijeh chun ama hon Shiloh a Pakai kitepna van gam sepai te, Cherub vantil teni kikah’a cheng, Pathen Thingkhong pudingin mi asol’un, chule Eli chateni Hophni le Phinehas chu Pathen Kitepna Thingkhong chutoh ahung lhon khom’in ahi. \x + \xo 4:4 \xt Potdohbu 25:22\x*  
\v 5 Chutah chun Pakai Thingkhong chu Israel te ngahmun ahung lhun amu phat un, akipah lheh jengun, akipanau ogin chun leiset ahotling leuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun, “Ipi soh hitam?” tin Philistine miten adong uvin, “Gingleng lunga a ao gin’u ajah phat un, Hebrew mite ngahmun ging leng lung khu ipi thu hitam?” akitiuve. Chuin ama hon Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong ngahmun hunglhung ahi ti ahechen tauve.  
\v 7 Amaho alung linglao tauvin ahi. “pathen ho angahmun uva alhung tai,” tin asam’un, akicha tauvin ahi. Chuin amaho apeng uvin, “Ohe! Hiche hi vangsetna ahi!” Tumasanga chu hitobang thil hi ana um khalouhel ahi.  
\v 8 “Hitobang hat tah Israel Pathen a konna kon eihuhhing jou diu ham? Nei panpiuvin! Egypt gam'a gamthip a hivei jouse sugama pathen ho chu ahiuve.  
\v 9 Hitobang kisatna anaum khapoi, Philistine! Ihatlou ule Hebrew mite soh a ium diu ahi! pasal bangin dingun, chule sat un!” akitiuve.   
\p
\v 10 Chuin Philistine ten jong nasatah in gal asat un ahile, Israel mite chu ajou un mihem tamtah jong athat tauvin ahi. Hiche nikho chun Israel te mi 30,000 athiuvin, athimoh chengse chu angahmun lam'ah ajam tauvin ahi.  
\v 11 Pathen Kitepna Thingkhong jong alahpeh un, Eli chapa teni Hophi le Phinehas jong chu athat tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Eli Thempu Thi  
\p
\v 12 Benjamin phung mikhat galmun a kon'in ahung lhailut in, hiche ni ma-ma chun Shiloh ahunglhungin, apon taldeh duh le aluchung’a leisetnat dehduh pumin ahung lhailut in, hichun agentheina avetsah ahi.  
\v 13 Eli chu lampam'a touna chung khat a touva anavet ahin, chule thusoh chu ajah nom ahi. Ajeh chu Pathen Thingkhong akipohdoh jeh uchun alungsung akithing in ahi. Chule hiche mipa khopi sung ahunglut phat chun thusoh chu aseijin ahile, khopi pumpi miho chu hakan akap tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 “Hiche awgin kithong khu ipi ham,” tin Eli in adongin ahi.  
\p Thupopa chun Eli chu thusoh chu aseipeh tai.  
\v 15 Eli chu tehse kum somko le get, amit in kho mulou ahitai.  
\v 16 Aman Eli heng’ah, “Keima tutah a chu galmun'a konna hung’ah kahi, keima tah tunia hiche mun a chu uma kahi,” ati.  
\p Hichun Eli in, “Ipi iti nam?” tin adonge.   
\p
\v 17 Hichun thupopan, “Israel ten Philistine te chu alal tai, mipite akisat chaptai chule nacha teni Hophni le Phinahas jong athat tauve chujongleh Pathen Thingkhong jong ala tauve,” tin ana donbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Thupopan Pathen Thingkhong ala tauve ti thucheng ajah-jah chun Eli thempu kelkot pang langa atouna a kon'in anunglhuh in ahi. Aman angong akitaboh in athitai, ajeh chu ama chu ateh lheh tan chule atahsa gih jong apohlal lheh ahi. Ama chun kum somli jen Israel te thutan vaihom a jong ana pang ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Eli thempu mounu, Phinehas inneipi, naovop ahin, anao penna ding naija ahitan, a inneipu thi le atehpu thi chule Pathen Thingkhong kipohmang thu ajah jah chun naoso nat in ahin phan anavah pai-paijin ahi.  
\v 20 Amanu chu naopen nat in athitai, ahinlah athi masangin naodom nun atilkhouvin alhamon in, “Kicha hih in, Pasal naosen khat naneiye,” ati peh e. Ahinlah amanun ima ana donbut thei tapoi.   
\p
\v 21 Naosen min chu Ichabod asahtai, (“Loupina hoiya um hitam?” tina ahi), ajeh chu, “Israel loupina chu akiladoh tai.” Amanun hiche min asahpehna jeh chu Pakai Thingkhong min akipohmang jeh le, atehpu le a inneipu athi tah jeh a asah ahi.  
\v 22 Hiti chun amanun Pathen Thingkhong alahmang peh jeh uva, “Loupina chu Israel te toh kikhen kang ahitai,” tia asei ahi.   
\c 5  
\s1 Pathen Thingkhong Philistine Gam'a Atham  
\p
\v 1 Philistine ten Pathen Thingkhong alah jouvun, Ebenezer galmun'a kon'in Ashdod khopi alhut tauve.  
\v 2 Ama hon Pathen Thingkhong chu apu uvin Dagon milim houna inah akoi tauve,  
\v 3 Ahin ajing jingkah matah in Ashdod khosung miten agavet ule Dagon chu Pakai Thingkhong masang ah chun amaichang in tollang ana ngan ana lhun ahi. Chuin ama hon Dagon chu aphong dingun, akitunna ma-ma a chun akoikit tauvin ahi.  
\v 4 Ahin ajing jingkah in angai ngaiyin, Dagon chu Pakai Thingkhong masang'ah chun amaijin tollang ana ngan ana lhukit in ahi. Tuchungin vang, akhutphang teni le aluchang chu tanbohsan kotbul lamah ana um'in, Dagon atahsa bou chu kitup chet in ana kijam'in ahi.  
\v 5 Hijeh chun Dagon thempupa hihen lang, koi hijongleh Ashdod khoa Dagon insunga hung jouse chun Dagon kijamna mun chu akeng’a ana chotpha louhel'u ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hijeh chun Pakai khut gihtah chu Ashdod mite chungah gih tah in achun, chule amaho le akho kom'a kho ho chung’a chun tijat umtah in abol genthei lheh tan ahi.  
\v 7 Hichu mipi ten ahetdoh phat un, akapjah jengun, “Eihon Pathen Thingkhong ikom uva ikoisot theilou diu ahi! Ama chu eiho toh kidou ahi bouve, ipathen'u Dagon toh eisuh mangtha diu ahi bouve,” atiuvin ahi.  
\v 8 Hijeh chun ama hon Philistine milen milal jouse aheng uvah akou khom un, “Israel Pathen Thingkhong hi i-ilo diu hitam?” atiuve.  
\p Chuin vaihom hon adonbut’un, “Israel Pathen Thingkhong chu Gath lamah kipo tahen” tin akinopto tauvin ahi. Hijeh chun ama hon Israel Pathen Thingkhong chu Gath lamah apolut tauve.  
\v 9 Pathen Thingkhong Gath a agalhun phat chun, Pathen khut gihtah chu mite chunga achun, khopi sunga mite chu alen aneo abonchauvin ajep in, uilut alansah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hijeh chun ama hon Pathen Thingkhong chu Ekron khopi ah atoldoh kit tauve, ahin Ekron miten amu phat un akapjah kit jengun, ama hon “Israel Pathen Thingkhong ahin thahlut jengu hi, eiho hi thigam nau hen,” eitiuva ahi atiuve.  
\v 11 Hichun mipite hon Philistine lamkai ho thu apeuvin, ngehna aneiyun, “Lungset tah in Israel Pathen Thingkhong hi agamlang uva na thahlut pehlou uva ahileh iboncha uva eithagam dingu ahi,” akitiuve. Ajeh chu hiche khopi jouse sunga chu suhgamna nasatah uma ahitan, Pathen khut chu gihsatah chua ahitai.  
\v 12 Mihem athimoh ho chunga chun uilut achun, chule khopia kon awgin hung gin chu van chan alhungin ahi.   
\c 6  
\s1 Philistine Ten Pathen Thingkhong Anung Le  
\p
\v 1 Pathen Thingkhong lha sagi jen Philistine gam'a aga thamin ahi.  
\v 2 Philistine mihon thempuho le gaothem miho akoukhom uvin hitin ana dong uvin, “Pakai Thingkhong chung chang thu hi ikalo diu hitam? Aumna ngaiya iti kasol diu ham? Nei seipeh uvin,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 3 “Israel Pathen Thingkhong chu nathah tengule thilpeh toh thah thauvin,” tin aseipeh un ahi. “Chonset thilto nato dingu chutileh natna chu kitang ding ahi, chuteng nadam uva, kitoldoh theilou natna chu Pathen khut ahi ti nahin het diu ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Hichun ama hon, “Itobang chonset thilto kabol diu ham?” tin ana dongun ahile, ama hon adonbut un, “Hiche natna chun nangho le na vaipo nga ho nabonchau chunga achuh jeh chun, nang hon Sana tum nga le sana a kisem jucha nga, na gamsungu sunohphah dungjuijin sem’un.  
\v 5 Hijeh chun gamsung suse na uilut lim le na jucha lim’u chu nasem uva chule Israel Pathen chu loupina napeh dingu ahi. Chuti henlang hileh nangho leh na Pathen hou chule nagam uva kon'in akhut ahin jangkhaisah dom ding ahi.  
\v 6 Nalung tahsah hih un chule doulung jong puhih un, Pharaoh le Egypt mite bangin lung puhih un. Pathen'in thil kidang abol ho jeh a hung potdoh ahibou uve.   
\p
\v 7 Tun bongkang thah sem uvin lang bongpi namkolyon pokhalou hel anou noichep lai cheh ni gakaiyun chule bongpi teni chu bongkang thah chu kaisah un, anou teni vang chu akom lhona kon'in inlam'ah hin nungkai tauvin,” ati.  
\v 8 “Pakai Thingkhong chu bongkang chunga chun tungdoh unlang akom'a chun chonset thilpeh dinga thilto sana tum, sana a kisem jucha lim le uilut lima kisem jong chu na semtha diu, chutengleh bongpi teni chu soldoh unlang achena nom nom’ah che tauhen.  
\v 9 Igamsung’u akhokal Beth-shemesh lang ajot a ahile gentheina te ho hin Pathen khut a kon ahi, ti hiche a konna chu hetthei ahi. Amavang achetah louva ahivangle igamnau chu ama khut ahipoi ti kihetdohna ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 10 Chuti chun aki seipeh nau bang-bang chun abol tauvin ahi, bongpi noitwi neilai ni kaisah dingin agongun bongnou teni vang chu ajaosah pouve.  
\v 11 Chuti chun Pakai Thingkhong chule chonset thilto sana jucha lim le uilut lim sana tum jong chu bongkang chunga chun akoi tauvin ahi.  
\v 12 Chuin bongpi teni chu jangkeijin Beth-shemesh geiyin ache lhungkei lhon'in ahi. Philistine mipite lamkai hon Beth-shemesh gamgi chan geijin ahin juilhung peh un ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Chule Beth-shemesh mihon phaicham'a chu suhlou chang ana at laitah u ahin, akhoda uva ahile Pakai Thingkhong ahung lhun amu phat un, hapan akipah lheh jeng tauve.  
\v 14 Bongkang chu Joshua kitipa loulaiya songpi kom'a ahung kingan chuin mipite hon bongkang thing meiya tidingin avolha uvin, bongpi teni chu athat un Pakaiya govamna maicham asem'un ahi.  
\v 15 Levi phungmi phabep khat in Pakai Thingkhong chule akom'a thingkhong sana jucha lim le sanatum uilut lim jong chu alalha uvin songpi chunga chun akoijun ahi. Hiche govamna maicham ho chu Pakaiya dingin asem’un ahi.  
\v 16 Philistine lamkailen mi nga in thil kibol ho jouse chu amu sohkei uvin chule hiche ni ma-ma chun Ekron ah akile kit tauve.   
\p
\v 17 Chule Philistine miten Pakai henga chonset thilto dinga ahin nungsol’u sana uilut lim, sana tum nga ho chu Ashdod akon khat, Gaza akon khat, Ashkelon akon khat, Gath akon khat chule Ekron a konna khat cheh ahi.  
\v 18 Chule sana jucha limho chun Philistine khopi nga ho, chule akimvella khoneoho, gamvaipo nga gamvaipoh na noiya umho vetsahna a ahin thot u ahi. Beth-shemesh khoa Joshua loulaiya songpi lentah khat a bongkang chu asolhah nau chu tujengin jong imatih chan geiya hettohsahna dingin aum jing nalaiye.   
\s1 Thingkhong Kiriath-Jearim’a Apohlut U  
\p
\v 19 Ahinlah Beth-shemesh a kon mihon thingkong sung avet jeh un mi som sagi Pakaijin athat tai. Hiti chun Pakai natoh kidang jeh chun mipi te nasatah in alunghem lheh jeng tauvin ahi.  
\v 20 “Hiche Pathen theng masanga hi koiham adingjou ding’ah?” tin mipin asam’un “Thingkhong chu hoiya itoldod diu hitam?” tin akidongto tauve.   
\p
\v 21 Hijeh chun thupo din Kiriath-jearim mipite henga mi asollun, “Philistine miten Pakai Thingkhong chu ahung thahlut tauve. Hungun lang, hung kilah un!” tin thu apohsah tauvin ahi.   
\c 7  
\p
\v 1 Hijeh chun Kiriath-jearim mite chu ahung uvin Pakai Thingkhong chu ahung kilah tauve. Ama hon Pakai Thingkhong chu thinglhang lama Abinadab inah alhut un, achingtup dingin Eleazer achapa ngansena anei tauve. \x + \xo 7:1 \xt 2 Samuel 6:2-4; 1 Thusimbu 13:5-7\x*  
\v 2 Thingkhong chu phat sottah kum somni vel Kiriath-jearim mun'a um ahi. Hiche phatsung chun Israel pumpi chu ana lunghem lheh jeng uve, ajeh chu ama hon Pakaijin nampi chu adalhah bang’a agel u ahi.   
\s1 Samuel In Israel Galjona Alamkai  
\p
\v 3 Chuin Samuel in Israel pumpi jah ah, “Nangho na lungthim pumpi uva Pakai heng'a hung kile nom mong nahiu le, nangho lah a um gamchom mite indoi Ashtoreth chu paidoh un. Chule Pakaiya dingin nalung sung’u kigong tup unlang, ama bou jen’un chutileh Aman Philistine mite a konna na huhdoh thei diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 4 Hijeh chun Israel miten jong amahoa um Baal chule Ashtoreth gamchom mite indoi chu apaidoh un,Pakai jengbou ahou tauve.   
\p
\v 5 Chuin Samuel in, “Israel mite jouse na boncha uvin Mizpah mun’ah hung kikhom un, chutengleh keima nangho dingin taovinge,” ati.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun Israel mite jong Mizpah mun’ah akikhom khom’un, Pakai hounan twi agathal uvin Pakai angsunga asung lhauvin, hiche nikho chun an angol uvin, Pakai douna a achonset nau akisih un ahi. (Hiche Mizpah mun'a chu Samuel Israel te thutan vaihom'a ahung panna chu ahi).   
\p
\v 7 Philistine lamkai hon Israel mite Mizpah mun’ah akikhom uve tithu ajah phat un, asepai ho akigontup sah un ahi. Philistine miten eihin nai tauve ti ajah phat un Israel mite jong akicha lheh jeng’un ahi.  
\v 8 “Pakai I-Pathen'un Philistine te khut a konna eihuhdohna diuva taona a ilhahsam louhel diu ahi,” tin Samuel kom'ah ngehna ahung neijuve.  
\v 9 Chuin Samuel in kelngoinou khat alan Pakai hengah todohna pumgo thilto maicham asem’in ahi. Aman Israel mite taopehna aneijin, Pathen'in ataona asanpeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Samuel in hiche govam thilto abol laijin Philistine te chu Israel te sat dingin ahung naijun ahi. Ahinlah Pakaijin kidangtah in van aginsah in, keh alhah sah in, hiche nikho chun Philistine te boinan alhun den’un, Israel chaten galjona anei tauve.  
\v 11 Chuin Israel te chu Mizpah a kon'in apotdoh un Philistine te chu anungdel’un, Beth-car aphah kah seuvin athat toupeh un ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Chuin Samuel in songtumlen khat alan Mizpah le Jeshanah kikah ah aphut in, aman hiche mun chu Ebenezer asah in ahi. Ajeh chu, “Hilai mun chan’ah Pathen'in ei kithopiuve,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Hijeh chun phat chomkhat sungin Philistine miten Israel mite ahin nokhum tapouve. Chule Samuel phatlai sungsen, Pathen thahatna jallin Philistine mite anem lhauvin ahi.  
\v 14 Chule Philistine miten Israel mite ana lahpeh u, Ekron chule Gath kom'a khopi ho jong Israel te alepeh kittan, chule agam kimvel jouse jong chu Philistine te khut a kon'in Israel ten alelah kit tauvin ahi. Chule Israel mite le Amon mite kah a chamna aumin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Chule Samuel in adamlai sungin Israel mite thu ana tan’in ahi.  
\v 16 Akumseh leh gamsung akhol kimvellin, Bethel le Gilgal, chule Mizpah a ache velkol jingin ahi. Aman Israel mite chungah, adeh in hiche munho lah a hin thu anatan jin ahi.  
\v 17 Chule Ramah kho a ain aum jeh chun ain’ah ahung kilejin, chule Israel te thu anatan jin ahi. Chule Samuel in Ramah a chun Pakaiya dingin maicham khat asemin ahi.   
\c 8  
\s1 Israel ten Leng Angeh U  
\p
\v 1 Samuel ateh lheh tan ahile, Israel lah a thutan vaihom ding’in achapa te apansah tai.  
\v 2 Joel le Abijah chu achate lah a akum tampen teni chu Beersheba khopi’ah thutan vaihom’in apang lhon'e.  
\v 3 Ahivangin apa toh abang lhonpoi, sum lam’ah akitah lhonpoi. Amanin sum nehguh pou abol lhon'in, thu adih in atanji lhon tapoi.   
\p
\v 4 Achainan Israel upaho jouse chu Ramah kho ah Samuel toh lunggel khomna anei uvin ahi.  
\v 5 Ama hon, “Ven, nangla nateh lheh jengtan, na chate jong nang toh abang lhonpon, Leng khat nei peuvin namdang ten anei banga thutan dingin,” atin aseipeh un ahi. \x + \xo 8:5 \xt Danbu Ni Na 17:14\x*   
\p
\v 6 Samuel vang chu athil ngaichat u chung’ah chun alung alhaipoi. Hijeh chun panpi ngaichan Pakai kom'a ache in ahi.  
\v 7 Pakaijin Samuel jah a, “Nakom'a asei jouseu bolpeh in, nang napaiju ahipoi, keijoh eipaiju ahi bouve, ama hon kei eideilou u ahibouve, aleng diuva eideilou u ahi,” tin adonbut tan ahi.  
\v 8 “Egypt gam'a konna kahin puidoh uva kipatna gamchom mite indoi bou ahou nom jo uve. Tua jong hitobangma a chu nang jong nabol'u ahi bouve,” ati.  
\v 9 “Asei jouseu chu bolpeh in, ahinlah leng khat in achung uva vai ahin hopna ding thua hin, kaangkhen chan gihsalin,” atipeh tai.   
\s1 Samuel In Israel Chate Agihsal  
\p
\v 10 Hijeh chun Samuel in, Pakaiya konna gihna thucheng ho chu Israel mite chu leng athumnau chungthu’ah chun aban ban’in ahetsah tan ahi.  
\v 11 Samuel'in Israel te jah ah, “Leng nahin nei uva aman nachung uva lengvai ahin hop tengleh, Leng in na chateu chu alah a sakol kangtalai ho leh sakol sepai dinga, chule sakol kangtalai masanga alhaisah diu ahi.  
\v 12 Abangkhat chu sepai lah a jalamkai chule lamkai napeh dingu, abang kit chu pumthou changa loukaiya apansah dingu, abangkhat chu kangtalai ase ho sema na pansah diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 13 “Lengpan na chanu teu amat uva anhon'a apansah uva, abang chu changlhah kanga apansah diu chujongleh abangkhat chu thao namtui sem’a apansah uva soh a anei diu ahi.  
\v 14 Nalou phalai hou jouse na lahpeh uva lengpithei lei le olive leija abol uva athao alah tengu leh atohkhompi ho apeh ding’u ahi.  
\v 15 Aman na changga le lousoh ho a konna som’a khat alah ding chule vaibol'a pang ho leh sohte ho apeh ding’u ahi.  
\v 16 Aman na pasal hou le numei hou soh dia akimat a, chule na gancha hoilai laiho ama dinga akilah ding ahi.  
\v 17 Aman na ganchahon ho jeng’a jong som’a khat angeh ding, nacham louva napeh ding ahi.  
\v 18 Chuche nikho chuleh nang hon nakilhen’u lengpa jeh a chu nahung ka diu chule Pakaijin naka gin’u na ngaipeh lou diu ahi,” tin aseipeh tai.   
\p
\v 19 Ahivangin mipite ho chun, “Hijeng jongleh Leng chu kadei nalai uve,” tin Samuel thusei chu angaisah dehpouvin ahi.  
\v 20 Hichun mipi ho chun, “Ka kimvel uva gamdang ho bangin, ka lengpauvin kachung uva thutan hen, gal kisat jeng’a jong hin eilamkai uhen,” ati tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun Samuel in Pakai kom’ah mipi ho thusei chu aseipeh kit in ahile,  
\v 22 Pakaijin, “Asei bang-bangu chun bolpeh inlang, Leng chu petan,” ati. Hichun Samuel jong anom’in mipi te ho chu a inlam cheh uva anungsol tan ahi.   
\c 9  
\s1 Saul In Samuel Akimupi  
\p
\v 1 Hichelai chun Benjamin chilhah mihaotah le mijong thu-nunjou mi khat aumin, ama chu Aphiah chapa, Becorath chapa, Zeror chapa, Abiel chapa, amin Kish kiti khat anaum'in ahi.  
\v 2 Achapa Saul chu Israel pasal lah a amel hoipen— gamsunga midang jouse sanga alu le alengkou sangjo ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Nikhat hi Kish sangan ho chu ana vahdoh in ahile, Kish in achapa Saul jah a, “Nasoh ho khat kipuijin lang sanganho hollin kipatdoh tan,” ati.  
\v 4 Hijeh chun Saul in asohho khat akipuiyin, Ephraim gamsunga Shalishah gamkol sung le akimvel sung chule Benjamin molsang dung jouse achon lhon'in ahinlah amujou lhon pon ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Achainan amani Zuph gam ahunglhun lhon phat in Saul in sohpa jah ah, “Hung in, in lam’ah kile tahite, achuti louva ahile eini le sanganho jeh in kapa ana lungkham val inte,” ati.  
\v 6 Ahinlah sohpan, “Ipi ham khat kalung’ah ahung kilange! Hichea hin Pathen mikhat aumin, hiche khopia hi cheng ahin, ama chu miho jousen jana sangtah apeh ahin, aman asei sei chu dih jeng ahi. Che hitin ama chu gaholdoh hite, ijeh inem-itile ichena ding lampi eiseipeh thei lhon ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hichun Saul in adonbut in, “Ama peh ding la imacha ineilhon pon, ineh lhon ding an jouse la akichai gamtan, ama peh ding ima ineilhon poi,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Ahinla asohpan, “Aphai, keiman kakhut ah dangka neokhat kaneiye, Pathen mipa chu hiche hi pehitin chule ipi soh em vehite,” ahinti.  
\v 9 (Hiche phatlai chun Pathen a konna hung kisei angai dinga ahile, “Mitva neipa kom'a cheu hitin gadong’u hite,” atijiuvin ahi).   
\p
\v 10 Hichun Saul in asohpa jah a, “Adih e, hiti chun gabol hite,” tin ana nom in ahi. Hichun hiche khopia mitva neipa hol din akipatdoh lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin lhang lang akaldoh lhon’a ahile, numei phabep twi-thal ding’a ahung amulhon'in amaho kom'a chun “Tunin mitva neipa chu aumdem?” tin adong lhon'in ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hichun ama hon ahin donbut lhon'in “Henge, hiche lampi jetlam’a chelhon lechun ama chu khopi kelkot phung kom'a chu um ding ahi. Mipi gan kilhaina a ache ahung lhun pettah ahi” atiuvin ahi.  
\v 13 Anne dinga akaltou masangin gangtah in che lhon'in lang gakimupi vah lhon'in, ajeh chu ahunglhun le gan kilhaina sa ho chu phatthei aboh kahsea mipin an aneh theilou diu ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin amani chu khopi sunga ahunglut lhon chun khopi kelkot agah jotpa lhon le Samuel chu Pathen houna mun’a dia ahung potdoh toh akitoh chet un ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Pakaijin Samuel kom'a jnahia chu ana seipehsa ahitan,  
\v 16 “Jing nikho tuphat don leh Benjamin phung’a kipat a pasal khat ka hinsol ding ahi. Ama kamite lah a lamkai dinga thao nanu ding ahi. Aman Philistine mite khut a konna Israel te ahuhdoh dingu, kamite kahin vetsuh a khotona puma, chule akanau kangailhah ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 17 Samuel in Saul amu phat in, Pakaijin ajah a, “Hiche mipa hi ahi kanasei chu, ama hin kamite alamkai ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Saul in Samuel kelkot phung lam’a ahin naipheiyin, “Mitva neipa in chu hoilai ham? Nei seipeh thei ding ham?” tin ana dongin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Chuin Samuel in adongbut in,“Keima hi mitva neipa chu kahi, chule Pathen houna mun'a ana kaltouvin, hia chun nei kimupin, hiche mun'a chu An ineh khom lhon ding chujongleh jingkah leh nahetnom ho chu na seipeh nange, chule na lampia nasol nange.  
\v 20 Chule nithum masang’a sanganho avahmang ho jeh chun lungkham hih in, hiho chu akimusa ahitai, na gelkhoh le nahet dia kaseipeh nom chu ahile nang le na insung mite hi Israel pumpin angeh uva avet jingu chu nahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun Saul’in, “Kei hi Israel phung lah a jong alhumpen, Benjamin phungmi kahin, ka-insung jong kaphung sung uva jong imacha loupen kahiuve, achutileh kei pen kom'a hitia hi ipi nasei nom ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Chuin Samuel in Saul le asohpa chu kikhopna indan lentah sunga dokhang lam'a ahin puilut in, akikou lamkai somthum ho lah a mun loupi pen a atousah tan ahi.  
\v 23 Chuin Samuel in anhonpa jah a, “Nahenga atumbeh in koiyin tia kapeh sachan chu hin choi tan,” ati.  
\v 24 Chuin an-hon pan sachan chu ahin choidoh in, Saul angsung’ah aluipeh tan, hichun Samuel in Saul jah ah, “Na-angsung’a kiluiyah hiche sachan hi nang dia kiluiyah ahi, nen, akikou chengse to tua naneh khom dia ka khendoh ahi,” ati. Chuti chun hiche nikho chun Saul in Samuel toh anekhom in ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Chuin Pathen ahounau munsang a konna khopi sung ahung kumlhah phat un, Samuel in Saul dingin indan chung’ah alupna ding asempeh in ahi.  
\v 26 Ajing jingkah matah in athouvun, chuin Samuel’in Saul indan chung’ah akou touvin, asoldoh theina dingin, “Thouvin,” ati.  
\v 27 Chuin anigel lhon'in in a kon’in apotdoh khom lhon'in khopi pam agei lhon'in Samuel in Saul jah ah, “Nasohpa ana masajep dingin seijin, Pathen a konna thu hung kisei kahetsah theina dingin,” ati.   
\c 10  
\s1 Samuel In Saul Leng Dia Thao Anu  
\p
\v 1 Chuin Samuel in olive thao thei khat alan, Saul luchung’ah asunglhan achop in ajah ah, “Keiman hiche kabolna ajeh chu Pakaijin nangma Israel chunga lamkai dinga, panmun sanga dinga na lhendoh ahitai.  
\v 2 Tunia hi nangma keija konna na potdoh tengleh, Benjamin gamgi Zelzah a Rachel lhan kom'a mini namu ding, sangan ho chu akimutai ti chu amanin aseilhon ding ahi. Napa sangan ho jeh a na lungkhamna chu akichai tan, tua hi nangni dinga lungkham ah ahi. Aman miho jah ah ka chapa namu uvem tin adong le-le in ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 “Chule chua kon chun chebe lhon lechun, Tabor phaicham lhungin natin chua chun Bethel’a Pathen henga chetouva mithum nakimutopi ding, khat pan kelcha nou thum, khatpan changlhah thum chule khatpan lengpitwi haikhat achoi namu ding ahi.  
\v 4 Chule amaho chun chibai naboh diu, changlhah ni napeh dingu, hichu akhut uva konna nakisan ding ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Chutengleh Phlistine sepaiho umna Pathen lhaang’a chu nahung ding, chule hiche khopia chu nahung tengleh tumging, khongcha, kuli, selangdah, amasang uva hintho a munsang’a konna hung kumlha themgao honkhat nakitopi ding, amaho chun gaothu asei dingu ahi.  
\v 6 Hiche phatteng chule Pakai Lhagao thahat tah a nachung uva hung chu ding, amaho toh gaothu nasei khom ding, chule michombeh khat nakiso ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 7 “Chule hiche melchihna ho hi nachung’a ahunglhun tengleh, Pathen'in naumpi jeh chun Pathen'in napuina lam-lam chu bol jengin.  
\v 8 Chutengleh nangma kei sanga Gilgal’a na chesuh masat ding, chule hikom’a chu ikimua govam kilhaina le chamna thilto gan kilhaina bol ding’a ikisuhto ding ahi. Nangman hikom'a chu nisagi chan nei nga ding chule maban a na thilbol ding ka seipeh ding nahi,” ati.   
\s1 Samuel Melchihna Ho Aguilhun  
\p
\v 9 Hiti chun Saul chu, Samuel’a konna kinungle dinga ache got chun, Pathen'in ama lung chom khat apen, hiche ni chun melchihna jouse chu aguilhung sohtai.  
\v 10 Saul le asohpa Gilgal’a ahunglhun lhon phat in, ama hon themgao thah loi khat amaho langa ahung amu phat un, Pathen Lhagao thahat tah in Saul chung’ah ahung chun, ama tah jong chun gaothu aseijin ahi.  
\v 11 Chuin Saul anahe ho chun, “Kish chapa, Saul jeng jong themgao hi ngap hitam?” atiuve.   
\p
\v 12 Chule chukom'a ding miho lah a khat in, “Apateu itobang hijongleu, mijouse themgao hitheiya ham?” ati. Hichea pat a chu, “Saul jeng jong Themgao soh ngap hitam?” tia hung kiseipan ahi. \x + \xo 10:12 \xt 1 Samuel 19:23,24\x*   
\p
\v 13 Chuin Saul in gaothu aseijou phat in, Pathen houna mun’ah ahung kaltouvin ahi.  
\v 14 Chuin Saul pangah pan ama le asohpa jah a, “Hoiya na gache ham?” tia adoh leh  
\p “Sangan hol'a kache lhon ahin, ahinlah kamu lhonpon, Samuel dong dinga kache lhon ahi,” tin Saul in ana donbut e.   
\p
\v 15 Apangah pan adong kit in, “O Samuel in ipi naseipeh lhon em?” tin adongkit in ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Saul in adonbut in, “Sangan chu akimutai tin eina seipeh lhon'in,” ahi. Ahinlah Saul in apangah kom'a Samuel in lenggam thu asei chu aseidoh poi.   
\s1 Samuel In Saul Leng Dia Aphondoh  
\p
\v 17 Chujouvin Samuel in Pakai masang’ah Israel mipite jouse Mizpah mun'a kimuto din akouvin ahi.  
\v 18 Ajah uva, “Hiche hi Pakai Israel te Pathen phondoh ahi: Keiman Egypt a kon'in kahin puidoh un, chule Egypt mite a kon'in kahin huhdoh un, chule namdang mite jouse bol gentheina a kon'in kahin hoidoh un ahi.  
\v 19 Ahin na genthei nauva konna ka huhdoh vangun, na Pathen’u tunin napai tauve chule hitin naseiyun, idang sangin leng khat kadei uve natiuve. Hijeh chun tun, naphung nachang uvin, na nam pumpi uvin Pakai ang’a dingin kigong un,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Chuin Samuel in Israel phung jouse Pakai masang’ah ahin puikhom’in chule vang asangin Benjamin phung chu alhengtai.  
\v 21 Benjamin phung insung jouse chu akoukhom kit in, chule amaho lah a chun Matri insung alhengdoh kit tan ahi. Achainan Kish cahpa Saul chu amaho insung lah a kon chun ana lhengdoh un ahi. Ahinlah ama chu ahol’u le aholmo tauve.  
\v 22 Chuin ama hon Pakai adoh uleh,  
\p “Thilkeo lah a akisel'e,” tin Pakaijin ahin donbut e.  
\v 23 Hiti chun ama hon jong Saul chu agamudoh uvin ahin puidoh uva mipi lah a adin leh, alengkouva pat chunglamse chu mijouse sangin asangjon ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Chuin Samuel in mijouse jah ah, “Hiche mipa hi ahi Pakijin na lengpa ding uva alhen chu ahi, Israel te lah a ama tobang adang aumpoi,” ati. Chuin mipi ten, “Lengpa damsot hen,” tin asam’un ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Chuin Samuel in mipite jah a lengpan atoh atham ding thudol ahil'in, chule lekhajol khat a asunlut in, Pakai angsung'ah akoitai. Chuin Samuel in mipi ho chu ama-ama incheh ah asoltai.   
\p
\v 26 Chuin Saul jong Gibeah kho a-inlam ah achetan, chule Pathen'in alungsung atohkhah mi honkhat in alhon piuvin ahi.  
\v 27 Ahinlah panna bei mi phabep chun, “Hiche pan iti eihuhdoh diu ham?” atiuve. Chuin ama hon ama nahsahmon abol’un, thilpeh imacha ahin choipeh pouvin ahi. Ahinlah ama athipbeh in ana nahsah pon ahi.   
\c 11  
\s1 Saul In Ammon Mite Ajo  
\p
\v 1 Lhakhat jouvin Ammon mi Nahash lengpa chun Israel khopi Jabesh-gilead dou dingin ahung kon'in ahi. Chuin Jabesh khoa cheng mijouse chun Nahash jah a, “Keiho toh kitepna khat sem uhitin chule nasoh kahi diu ahi,” tin atao tauve.   
\p
\v 2 Hichun Nahash in, “Aphai, ahinla aumdan khat sem uhite, Israel pumpi kajumso theina dia namit changu jetlam cheh ka kaldoh ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Hichun ama hon, “Achutile nisagi nei ngah un, Israel gamsunga mi sol uvinge, eikithopi diu koima ahung louva ahileh naheng uvah lut tauvinge,” tin Jabesh upahon adonbut tauve.   
\p
\v 4 Thupoho Saul umna Gibeah ahunglhun phat un mijouse mitchang kaldoh ding thu ajahdoh phat in khopi sunga mijouse akapjah jeng tauvin ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche pettah a chu Saul chu louva konna ganchahon nunga hunga ahi, chule khopi ahunglhun phat in, “Ipi thilsoh uma hitam? Ipi jeh a mipite hitobang tah a khu kap a hiuvem?” tin adongin ahile ama hon Jabesh thupole ho thu chu aseipeh tauve.   
\p
\v 6 Chuin Saul’in chuche thusoh ajah phat in, Pathen a konna lhagao achungah ahung chun, alung hanna chu ahung koujah jengin ahi.  
\v 7 Chuin bongchal ni athat in, achanbong bongin, Israel gamkai jousea ahom dingin thupole ho asol'in, “Samuel le Saul gal’a jui louva galkon lou jouse abongchal jouse hitia hi kichanpan ding ahi!” tin gihna jong aneijin ahi. Chule Pathen'in Saul lunghan chun mijouse akichat sah in, kilungkhat tah in ahung kikhom sohkeiyun ahi.  
\v 8 Chuin Saul’in Bezek mun’ah akhom khomin ahile Israel a kon mi 300,000, chule Judah a kon mi 30,000 akhom doh in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Saul in thupole ho chu Jabesh-gilead miho henga, “Jing sunkim le kithopina namu diu ahi!” tin thu ale thot in ahile hiche thusoh ajah phat un, khopi sungah kipana lentah ahung lhungin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Jabesh mihon agal mite ho kom'ah “Jing teng naheng uva kahung diu ahin, kachung uva nabol nom chan nabol theiju ahi,” tin aseipeh tauvin ahi.  
\v 11 Ahin, ajing jingkah matah in Saul ahung lhun’in, asepai te hopthum in ahom khen’in, khovah in amelma te ngahmun adelkhum’un, hiche jingkah sungse chun, Ammon mite athat in, ahingdoh chasun akithe cheh uvin, achang changin ajammang tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Chuin mipi hon Samuel jah a, “Ipi jeh a Saul ichung uva leng chang ding ham? tia seiho chu hoilai um gam'u hitam? Neipedoh un, that gam uvinge!” tin angeh un ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Ahin Saul in adonbut in, “Tunia hi mi khatcha kithat louding ahi, ajeh chu tuni hi Pakaijin Israel ahuhhing nikho ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin Samuel in mipi jah ah, “Hungun Gilgal ah cheu hitin, ilengpau gaphongdoh kit uhite,” ati.  
\v 15 Chuin mipite jouse chu Gilgal ah acheuvin, Pakai masang ah Saul chu Leng in asemdoh tahbeh tauve. Hiti chun Pakai angsung'ah chamna, kilhaina thilto gantha abol uvin, Saul jong Israel mite jong hapan akipah sohkei uvin ahi.   
\c 12  
\s1 Samuel In Lhahna Thu Asei  
\p
\v 1 Chuin Samuel chun Israel pumpi jah dingin thu aseijin, “Veuvin kaheng'a nasei jouseu kangaiyin, nachung uva vaihom ding leng khat jong kasempeh tauve.  
\v 2 Naleng’u hi tun nalamkai u jong ahitai, namasang laitah uva ka dinge, kumtam tehse samkang kahitai. Kachapa te to nakiloi diu ahi. Kachapan laiya kipan in tuni chan geijin na lamkaiyun kahung pangin ahi.  
\v 3 Tun hikom'a kaume, koi bongchal ahilou le koi sangan kalahpeh umkha em? Koi ka lheplhah umkha em? Koi ka suhgenthei umkha em? Koi kom'a sumguh thol'a ka lahpeh umkha em? Pakai le athaonu pa ang’ah kachung chang thu hettohsah pumin nei seipeh un, kana suhkhel aum jongleh tun sudih inge,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Mipin adonbut’un, “Aumpoi, nangman nei joulhep kha pouve, nangman keihoa kon'in thil neocha jeng jong nalapoi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 5 “Pakai le athaonu pa hi tunia na angsung laitah uva ahetoh ahi, kanung thu atheng’e” tin Samuel in aphongdoh in ahi. Chuin mipin,  
\p “Henge ama hi ahetoh ahi,” tin adonbut uve.  
\v 6 Samuel in abanjom in, “Aaron le Mose ana gong jong chu Pathen ahi, napu napa teu Egypt a konna hin puidohpa chu Ama chu ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 12:6 \xt Potdohbu 6:26\x*  
\v 7 “Hijeh chun, tun nangho le napu napa teu chunga Pakaijin thil kidang nasatah tah abol chengse ageldoh sah u bang chun Pakai masanga nangho dingdet un,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 “Israel mite Egypt a aumlaiyun, Pakai henga akap un ahile, Aman Mose le Aaron chu Egypt gam'a kon'in Israel te ahin puidoh sah lhon'in, hiche gam'a ahin lhut lhontai. \x + \xo 12:8 \xt Potdohbu 2:23\x*  
\v 9 Ahivangin mipi hon hetman louvin Pakai a Pathen'u asumil’un, aman Sisera, Hazor khopia sepai janel gal lamkai khut le Philistine te khut a chule Moab lengpa khut a apedoh in ahi. \x + \xo 12:9 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 4:2; \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 13:1; \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 3:12\x*   
\p
\v 10 Chuin amaho Pakai henga akap un, keihon Pakai ka dalhauvin Baal lim le Ashtoreth kahou jeh un kachonse tauve, ahinlah tun kamelma teu khut a kon'in nei huhdoh uvin, chutileh nangma kahou diu ahi atiuve. \x + \xo 12:10 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 10:10-15\x*   
\p
\v 11 Chutengleh, Pakaijin Gideon, Bedan, Jephthah chule Samuel asol in muntin'a na melma te hou khut a kon'in nei huhdoh un lungmong in acheng tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 12:11 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 7:1; \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 4:6; \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 11:29; \xt 1 Samuel 3:20\x*   
\p
\v 12 “Pakai na Pathen'u chu na lengpau ahilaiyin, Ammon chate lengpa Nahash nangho douna a ahung namu phat un, nang hon kaheng'a, ahipoi, leng khat in kachung uva vai ahom ding ahi bouve natiuve, \x + \xo 12:12 \xt 1 Samuel 8:19\x*  
\v 13 Tun veuvin, nang hon nalhen ule na ngaichat u lengpa chu hikom'a aum'e chule veuvin, Pakaijin nachung uva leng khat atungtai.   
\p
\v 14 Tun Pakai nagin uva chule nahou uva, chule athusei chu na ngai uva, na doudal loubeh uva ahileh nangho le na lengpauvin Pakai chu Pathen ahi ti avetsah na ahitai.  
\v 15 Ahinlah Pakai thusei chu na doudal vang uleh chule na ngaipeh lou uva ahivang le akhut nachung uva gihsa ding nang le namite chunga chu ding ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Pakaijin, thil lentah tah abol ding ho, tun ding doh uvin lang veuvin,” ati.  
\v 17 “Nanghon naheuve, tuphat hi suhlou chang atlai ahin go ajuji pon ahi, ahin tao leng Pakaijin van kithinsah intin go ju ding ahi. Hiteng chule Pakai kom'a leng nathum'u chu Ama douna melse tah a chonse nahiu kihet tauvin nate,” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Chuin Samuel in Pakai akouvin ahile, hiche nikho chun Pakaijin van-gin le keh ahin sol’in, hiti chun mipi chun Pakai le Samuel aging tauvin ahi.  
\v 19 Mijouse chun Samuel hengah, “Pakai henga nei taopeh un, achuti louva ahileh ka thigam diu ahi,” atiuve. “Tua hi leng ithum jeh uva chonset ikiholbeu ahitai,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun Samuel in, “Kicha hih uvin, nabol khel’u ahitai, ahinlah Pathen phaten dihtah in hou uvin na lungthim pumpi uvin houvun, chule kinungle kit bol hih un,” atin ahi.  
\v 21 “Nungchon hihbeh un, nungchon a milim paotheilou ho chun napanpi louhel diu ahi, hiho chu panna bei jeng ahiuve.  
\v 22 Pakaijin amite itih hijongleh adalhah louhel ding ahi, ajeh chu adalhah a ahile aman amin lentah chu asuh minset ding ahi. Hijeh chun Pakaijin nangho amite dia agot hi ama lunglhaina ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 “Keiman vang nangho ding’a taopeh hi kangah a, hichu Pakai douna a kachonset louhel ding ahi. Chule thilpha le thildih nabol jing diu hi nangho kahil jing diu ahi.  
\v 24 Ahinlah hiche hi na boltei diu ahi, Pakai chu ging’un chule tahsan umtah in jen’un, chule nangho ding’a thil kidang abol jouse chu geldoh jing’un.  
\v 25 Ahinlah na chonset jom jing uva ahileh, nangho le na lengpau kisumang ding ahi,” ati.   
\c 13  
\s1 Philistine Douna Gal Che Jom  
\p
\v 1 Saul leng’a ahungpan chun akum somthum alhingtai chule kum somli le ni sungin lengvai anapon ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Saul in Israel sepaiho lah a kon'in atumbeh in mi 3,000 alheng doh in, mi 2,000 chu Micmash le Bethel mol'a aumpin, 1,000 vang chu Saul chapa Jonathan toh Benjamin gam Gibeah khopiah aum'un chule mipi amoh cheng chu a inlam cheh uva asoltan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Hiche phat chomkhat jouvin, Geba ah Philistine sepai touho chu Jonathan in asat in ahile, Philistine te chu ajou tauve. Hijeh chun Saul in gamsung tin'ah kelki amut in, chule hitin aseiye, “Hebrew mipi te, hiche hi ngai tem’un, Philistine te dounan thoudoh un,” ati.  
\v 4 Israel mite jousen Saul in Philistine te chu Geba ngahmun khat abulu in asuhmang jeh in Philistine ten masang’a sangin Israel te chu ahot tauve tithu ajahdoh phat un Israel sepai apumpi chu Gilgal’a Saul kithopi dia kikhom khom din thupeh anei tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Chuin Philistine te chu Israel tetoh kisat dingin akigong un, asakol kangtalai u 3,000, sakol touthem mihem 6,000 akigong’un chule mipi galsat ding chu twikhanglen kam'a neldi jat in atam’un ahi.  
\v 6 Israel mite nochintoa aum’u ahetdoh phat un, mipi te chu atijauvin alungdong gam tauvin, songkoho ah, hamboh lah ah, chule kotong dung'ah akisel gam tauve.   
\p
\v 7 Mi phabep Jordan vadung agalkaiyun, Gad le Gilead gamsung ah akisel'un ahi.  
\s1 Saul Lengpa Thungailou Chule Samuel In Apho  
\m Hiche kahlah a chun Saul Gilgal ah aum'e chule amite chu tijat in akihot hot jengun ahi.  
\v 8 Saul in Samuel chu nisagi jen angah in, hiti chun Samuel in jong akitepna banga Gilgal’a ahung thei tahlou jeh in, mipite akithe cheh gam tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 13:8 \xt 1 Samuel 10:8\x*  
\v 9 Chuin Saul in, “Govam thilto ho leh chamna thilto neihin choi peh un” atin ahi. Chule Saul ama tah in govam thilto ho lhandohna aneitan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Saul in govam thilto lhandohna aboljou tah in, Samuel jong ahunglhung paiyin, chuin Saul chun kimutopi a chibai boldin apotdoh in ahi.  
\v 11 Hichun Samuel in, “Ipi bolla nahim?” tin adongin ahi.  
\p Saul in jong adonbut in, “Nang la nikho kitepna banga hung louva, mipi ho jouse keija konna akithe cheh uva chule Philistine te gal adia Micmash a akikhop khom’u kamu tai.  
\v 12 Hijeh chun kaseijin, “Tua hi Philistine te eiho dou dinga Gilgal’a kigosadem a um u ahitan, Pakai henga panpina jeng jong kana thum manlou ahitai, hiche jeh a chu govamna thilto kanabol ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Hichun Samuel in adonbut in, “Iti ngol'a ngol nahim! Nangman Pakaijin na Pathen thupeh ho nanit tapoi, asei ngai lechun Pakaijin Israel te lenga imatih chan’a dinga natung jing tadinga.  
\v 14 Ahinla, tua hi na lenggam kichai ding ahitai. Pakaijin ama lungthim he mikhat alhen ahitai. Pakaijin amite chunga vaihom ding hi lhendohsa akoi ahitai. Ijeh inem itileh nangin thupeh nanit tapoi,” ati. \x + \xo 13:14 \xt Act 13:22\x*   
\p
\v 15 Chuin Samuel in Gilgal adalhan ajotna ding’a akichetai. Adang hon vang asepai te kithopi dia che Saul nung ajui tauve. Hichun amaho Gilgal apat Benjamin gamsung’a Gibeah ah achetou tauve. Hichun Saul in asepai te ama nungjui ho chu avetoh in ahile pasal mi 600 tobang asimdoh tai.  
\v 16 Chuin Saul le achapa Jonathan chule amani toh umkhom miho chu Benjamin gamsung’a Geba achun aum tauve, ahinlah Philistine mihon Micmash a panmun asem’un ahi.  
\v 17 Hichun Philistine te, mibulu ding loithum chu panmun'a kon chun ahung potdoh un, loikhat chu Shual gam Ophrah jotna lampi chu ajon’un,  
\v 18 chule loikhat chun lhumlam a um Beth-horon lam chu ajonun, chule loi khat chun Zeboim phaicham gamthip kingahna gamgichin lampi ajot un ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hichelai chun Israel gam pumpia chun thihkheng khatcha ana umpon ahi, ajeh chu Philistine ten achuti louva ahile Hebrew miten chemjam le tengcha kikhen get unte atiu ahi.  
\v 20 Hijeh a chu Israel te chu amitakip langkon, aloukaina, aheichau chule atupheng’u, akhet hem nom uva ahile akheng dinga Philistine te henga chesuhji ahiuve.  
\v 21 Tupheng, langkon thih, thihka, tucha thihmol, heichang suhhemna man chu paisa khat tobang bep ahi.  
\v 22 Chuti chun chuche nikhoa kon’in Saul le Jonathan toh kiloi miho khut a chun chemjam le tengcha khatcha Saul le achapa Jonathan tilou adang akimupon ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Philistine sepai hon ho chu Micmash lampi chang din achedoh un ahi.   
\c 14  
\s1 Jonathan Hansan Thilgon  
\p
\v 1 Nikhat hi Jonathan in agal manchah polea pangpa kom'a, “Hungin Philistine sepaiho umna langa khun galkai hite,” ati. Ahinlah Jonathan in, ipi abol ding chu apa henga ana hetsah pon ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Phat chomkhat jouvin, Saul in mi jagup chu Gibeah khopi pam langa Migron mun'a kolbuthei phung vella chun ana khom khom’in ahi.  
\v 3 Saul miho lah a chu Ahijah chun thempu von chu akivon in ahi. Ahijah chu Ichabod sopipa Ahitub chapa ahin, Ahitub chu Phinehas chapa, Shiloh’a um Eli chapa Pathen thempu tupa ahi.  
\p Jonathan in Israel te ngahmun adalhai ti koiman ahetlou ahi.  
\v 4 Philisitne te ngahmun lutna dia chu Jonathan in lampi jet le veiya songpi kochetchut khat gel aumin, songpi khatpa min chu Bozez ahin, khatjopa chu amin Senez ahi.  
\v 5 Sahlam a songpi khat aum in, khatjoh Micmash lhanglam a um, khat chu Geba lam a um ahi.  
\v 6 Hichun Jonathan in, “Hiche cheptan lou sepai ho ngahmun lah a khun cheu hite, Pakaijin eini eikithopi tei lhon ding ahi, ajeh chu Pakai chu koiman atin jou theilou ding ahi, Aman gal eijosah tei diu ahi, lhomcha hijong leuhen ijotei diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hichun gollhang avon popan, “Ipi hile phante natipen chu bol jengin, chule keima nakom'a kaumnai, na gellhuh bangin bol jengin,” tin adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Jonathan in, “Achutile apha lheh e, eini galut hitin, amaho gakimu sah hite,” ati.  
\v 9 Ahinla ama hon, ‘Na umna lhon'ah dingden lhon’in achuti louva ahileh katha diu ahi atiuva ahile ikaltou louding,  
\v 10 ahinlah, ‘Hung kaltou lhon'in kisat ute’ atiuva ahileh ikaltou lhon ding ahin, hichu Pakaiya konna melchihna khat hi ding ahin aman eikithopi lhon’a ijo lhon ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin Philistine ten amu phat un ahoh un, “Veuvin, Hebrew miho akosunga kon'in ahung potdoh tauve,” atiuve.  
\v 12 Chuin khopi ngah a umpa chun Jonathan ahin sam’in, “Hichea hung kaltouvin, thil khat na vetsah unge atiuve,” ati.  
\p Chuin Jonathan in agalvon popa jah ah, “Hungin hung kaltouvin, Pathen’in eipanpi lhona ijotei lhon ding ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Chuin amanin akhut le akeng atho lhon'in akaltou lhon'a ahile Philistine mite chu Jonathan masanga abohkhum gam tauvin, anung’a hung kaltou agalvon popan ana that thu-thu jengin ahi.  
\v 14 Amanin, mi somni athat lhon'in, atahsau chu acre keh khat a len sung ‘ah athethang lhon'e.  
\v 15 Hiti chun gangtah in, Philistine te gamsung ho lah le camp jousea thusoh chu ahung kithang soh tan, loujaova mipi holah le mijouse lah a chun tijatna nasatah in aum tan, sepai hon ho leh thilchom ho jong ati akihot hot un chule liingjong akihot e.   
\s1 Israel ten Philistine Te Ajo U  
\p
\v 16 Chuin Saul in Benjamin gam'a Gibeah gam gallang chu avet a ahile Philistine mite simsenlou chu muntin gamtin'ah ajam cheh gam tauvin ahi.  
\v 17 Saul in asepai te jah a thu apen, “Min kou unlang, koi-koi um’a, koi-koi umlou ham,” ati. Hitia chu akihol ule Jonathan le agal manchah popa aum tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Chuin Saul chu Ahijah chunga alunghang in, “Thempu von chu hilam’ah hin choiyun!” ati. Hiche pet a chu Ahijah chu Israel te masanga thempu von kivon'ah ahi.  
\v 19 Ahin Saul thempupa toh aki houlim sungse chun Philistine ngahmun sunga chun boina ahaginjep jep in ahi. Hichun Saul in thempupa jah a, “Imacha akhohpoi chejom jingu hite,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Chuin Saul le asepai te chu galmun'a ahin nokhum ule Philistine mite chu amaho leh amaho akithatto tauvin, boina le kihet khelna nasatah asoh tan ahi.  
\v 21 Chule tumasang’a Hebrew mi Philistine mite lah a ana jamlut ho jong chu Saul, Jonathan le Israel lah a adang-dang ho langa ahung kiheilut jong aumin ahi.  
\v 22 Hiti chun, Ephraim molsanga ana kisel Israel te jouse chun Philistine te ajam tauve tithu ajah phat un, amaho jong chun galsat na a chun hatah in anung’u adel’un ahi.  
\v 23 Chuti chun hiche nikho chun Pakaijin ami Israel te ahuhdoh in chule gal kisat chu Beth-aven geijin gal akisat peh’un ahi.   
\s1 Saul Ngol-hoi Kihahsel  
\m
\v 24 Hiche nikho chun Israel te chu alung genthei lheh un ahi, ajeh chu, “Saul in kamelma te phu kalah theina dingin, nilhah ahi kahsea annea chu sapset changhen tia mipi chu akihahsel sah ahi.” Hijeh a chu sun nilhum keiya koima anne umlou ahi.  
\v 25 Hijeh chun, ama hon gamlah lampia chu khoibel khat ana um amu vang’un koiman ane pouvin ahi.  
\v 26 Chuin khoiju chu mipi koima chan ana ne-ngam pouvin ahi. Ajeh chu kihahselna chu akichat u ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Ahinlah Jonathan in apa thupeh chu ana jahlou jeh in, atenggol muh in khoiphang khat agah sun in, agah te a ahile, atha akido ma-ma jengin ahi.  
\v 28 Ahin mikhat in hichu ana mudoh in, “Napan mipi nasatah a eigihsal uva tunia nilhum masanga anne a mi chu sapset changhen tia eigaosap jeh uva koiman kaneh lou u ahi, hijeh a chu mipi jong hung lhasam'ah ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 29 Chuin Jonathan in, “Kapan gamsung hi agenthei sah ahi. Hitobang thupeh chun eiho ma-ma eisuhgenthei u ahi. Ven hiche khoiju chu themkhat kate jeh a kamit hi iti hung ha doh hitam?” ati.  
\v 30 Mipi jong hin amelma teu thil achom nauva amu hou hi aning anop in nele phachom louding ham? Hijeh a chu eihon tuni geija Philistine te tamtah itha theilou-u hilou ham? ati.   
\p
\v 31 Chule hiche ni chun Micmash a kipat Aijalon geijin Philistine te chu anung adel’un athat peh un chule mipi chu alhasam lheh jeng tauvin ahi.  
\v 32 Chuin mipi chu thil kichomho chunga achu uvin, kelgoi ho, bongchal ho, bongnou ho chu tollhanga athat un thisan pum chun aneuvin ahi.  
\v 33 Mikhat in Saul jah a, “Mihon sa thisan pumin aneuvin Pakai dounan achonse tauve,” tin ana seidoh peh un ahi.  
\p Chuin Saul in, “Na thilbol’u chu adihlou ahi, songtum lentah khat kihol unlang kilih piuvin,” ati. \x + \xo 14:33 \xt Semtilbu 9:4; Thempu Dan 7:26,27; 17:10-14; 19:26; Danbu Ni Na 12:16,23; 15:23\x*  
\v 34 Saul in aseibe kit in, “Sepai ho lah a khun chelut unlang a gancha u, akelngoi u, akelcha u jong kaheng’ah hin choiyun.  
\p Hichelai mun'a hin that unlang chule naneh masang’un athisan chu lhoh kanghel un. Asa le thisan nehkop jeh a Pathen dounan chon dauvin,” ati.  
\v 35 Chuin Saul in, Pakaiya dingin maicham asemin, hiche maicham chu Saul in Pakaiya dinga maicham asem masat pentah ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Chuin Saul in amite kom'a, “Eihon janteng kitolsuh uhitin Philistine te nung del uhitin, khovah kah in amaho chu thatgam uhitin chomgam uhite,” ati.  
\p Hichun mipi jong, “Pha nasah sah chu bol jengin,” atiuve.  
\p Ahivangin Thempupan, “Pathen dong masaute,” ahinti.  
\v 37 Chuin Saul in Pathen adongin, “Philistine te nung kadel diu ham? Kajo nadiuva nei panpi diu ham? Ahinlah hiche nichun Pathen'in adonbut tapoi.   
\p
\v 38 Chuin Saul in lamkaiho kom'a aseijin, “Adih lou khat aumtai! Galmi lamkai jouse hikom'a hungun. Tunia ipi suhkhel ineijum? Kikhol uhite chonset hi hoilaiya um ham? Hin kholdoh un.  
\v 39 Ajeh chu Israel huhhing'a hingjing Pakai min'a kasei ahi, kachapa Jonathan chunga um ahijongleh ama jeng jong thon louhel ’a thi tei-tei ding ahi,” ati. Ahinla mipi ho jouse lah a konna ipia konna boiham ti koiman aseipoi.   
\p
\v 40 Chuin Saul in aseijin, “Nangho lang khat ah um unlang, kei le ka chapa Jonathan lang khat ah um lhon inge,” ati.  
\p Chule mipi ten Saul kom'a chun, “Phante tia nagel chu aphapen ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 41 Chuin Saul ataovin, “O Pakai, Israel te Pathen, koi hi dih a, koi hi dihlou hitam nei seipeh un,’ ati. Hichun vang asan ule Jonathan le Saul lhendoh ahung hin, hijeh chun mipi te chu ahoidoh tai. \x + \xo 14:41 \xt Minbu 27:21; 1 Samuel 28:6\x*   
\p
\v 42 Chuin Saul in, “Tun vang sang kit uhitin kei le Jonathan kah a dingin,” Tun Jonathan chu athemmon ahung kilangdoh tai.   
\p
\v 43 “Ipi na bolkhel ham nei seipeh in?” Hiti chun Saul in Jonathan kom'a adongin ahi. “Khoiju themkhat kana tep e,” tin Jonathan akiphong doh tai. “Tenggol muh a themcha khat bou, hichun thina asothei ham?” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 44 Saul in “Henge Jonathan, nathi tei ding ahi! Hiche jeh a hi nathi louleh Pathen'in kei eideng henlang chule eithat hen” ati.   
\p
\v 45 Ahin mipi ten Saul kom'ah, “Jonathan in Israel dia gal lentah eijopeh u ahin, Jonathan hi thi ding ham?” tin ana dongui. Hichu ahi ding ahile, Pathen'in jada hen, hingjing Pakai min'a kaseiju ahi, aluchunga kon samjang khat jong lha louding ahi. Ajeh chu tunin Pathen toh atongkhom in ahi,” atiuvin. Hijeh chun mipi ten Jonathan ahuhdoh un, athisah tapouve.   
\p
\v 46 Saul chu Philistine te nung adel nauva kon'in achetou tan chule Philistine te jong aum nauvah ache tauve.   
\s1 Saul Sepai te Lolhin  
\m
\v 47 Chuti chun Saul in Israel mite chunga lengvai anapon, muntin'a amelma te jouse, Moab, Ammon chate, Edom, Zobah lengho chule Philistine mite toh akidouvin akiheina lam jousea gal ajoupeh in ahi.  
\v 48 Aman thil lentah Amalek mite asat in, ajouvin, chule amaho chom gam'a miho khutna kon'in Israel te ahuhdoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 49 Tun Saul chapa te chu Jonathan, Ishbosheth, chule Malkiishua ahiuvin. Chule achanu teni lah a apeng masanu min Merab ahin, chule aneonu min Michal ahi.  
\v 50 Chule Saul inneipi min Ahinoam ahin, Ahimaaz chanu ahi. Chule ajanel gal lamkaipa min chu Abner ahin, Saul pangahpa Ner chapa ahi .  
\v 51 Chule Saul pa, Kish chule Abner pa, Ner chu ani lhon'a Abiel chapa hicheh lhon ahi.   
\p
\v 52 Chule Saul nikholai sungse chun Philistine mite toh kidouna chu anasa lheh jengin ahi, Chuti chun Saul in mihat le mihangsan amupou pouva ahile amanin ama a dingin akipui jengin ahi.   
\c 15  
\s1 Saul In Amalek Mite Asuhmang  
\p
\v 1 Nikhat Saul kom'a Samuel chun, “Israel te chunga leng dinga nangma thaonu dinga eina sol’a chu Pakai ama tah chu ahi. Hijeh a chu tua Pakai thusei hi na ngai ding ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 15:1 \xt 1 Samuel 10:1\x*  
\v 2 Hiche hi van gam sepai te Pakaijin aphondoh ahi: Israel mite Egypt a konna ahung potdoh uva chu lampia iti ana lamtin jeh uva Amalek chunga hi talen kamatsah ding ahitai. \x + \xo 15:2 \xt Potdohbu 17:8-14; Danbu Ni Na 25:17-19\x*  
\v 3 Tun che unlang Amalek mite chu abonchan gathat gamkeijun, nao noichep ho geija natha ding’u, khatcha jong nakhen lou diu, pasal, numei, chapang, naosen, bong, kelcha, sangongsao, chule sangan ho chan geiya natha gam diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Chutah in Saul in mipi ho chu Telaim mun’ah akhomin, amaho chu Israel mite a kon'in keng sepai 200,000 chule Judah a konna 10,000 ahiuve.  
\v 5 Chuin Saul le a sepai te chu Amalek te khopi ah alut un, phaicham mun khat ah chun angah tauve.  
\v 6 Saul in Ken mite ho gihna thu apen: “Amalek miho umna a kon'in potdoh un, achuti louva ahile Amalek miho toh nathi tha dingu ah. Nangho vang chu kami Israel chate jouse Egypt a konna ahung potdoh uchun hepina namusah un ahi,” tin thu apen ahi. Chuin Ken mihon apot akigot un adalha tauve.   
\p
\v 7 Chuin Saul in Amalek mite chu Havilah apat solam Egypt toh kigalsai Shur khopi lutna geijin gal ana sat in asumang peh tan ahi.  
\v 8 Chuin aman Amalek lengpa chu ahingin aman in midang jouse chu chemjam in athat sohhel tan ahi.  
\v 9 Ahinlah Saul le mipi chun, Amalek mi Agag le kelngoi, kelcha, bongchal thao ho leh ahoipen ho ahing hoijun, aphalou ahoilou chengse chu asumanghel tan ahi.   
\s1 Pathen In Saul Leng Dia Apai  
\p
\v 10 Chuin Pakaijin Samuel kom'ah aseijin ahi,  
\v 11 “Saul lenga kana tun hi kakisih tai ajeh chu aman eidonse tapon chule ka thupeh ho jong anit tapoi,” ati. Hiche thu Samuel in ajahdoh phat in alung atongkhan jan khovah hellin Pakai hengah akaptai.   
\p
\v 12 Ajing jingkah matah in Samuel jong Saul kimupi dingin achetan ahile, mi khat in, “Saul chun Carmel khopia ama le ama kihet jingna ding mangmo khat akisem din Gilgal lam achesuh tan ahi,” tin aseipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Chuin Samuel in Saul chu amu phat in, Saul in kipah tah in ana salamin, “Pakaijin phatthei naboh hen, keiman Pakai seibang bangin kabol tai,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Samuel in, “Ahile ka nabeng’a kelngoi hamgin le bongchal hamgin kajah hi ipiba hija ong?” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun Saul in adonbut in, “Adih’e, ka sepai te hon ama le Amalek mite a konna ahin kaiju ahi, ajeh chu mipi hon kelngoi ho leh bongchal aphapen penho chu, ‘Pakai na Pathen lhaina dinga ahing hoiju ahi,’ adang ho vang ka sumanghel tauve,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Chuin Samuel’in Saul kom'a aseijin, “Thip in! Tujan Pakaijin kaheng'a thu asei hi ngaijin!” ati.  
\p Hichun Saul in, “Ipi na seipeh em?” tin Saul in adongin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Chuin Samuel in, “Nangma neocha nakigel maithei ahi, nangma Israel nam mite jouse lah a lamkai nahi hilou ham? Pakaijin leng dinga thao nanu ahi.  
\v 18 Chule Pakaijin anatong dinga nasol'a, chen michonse Amalek mite gathat gamkeijin,' ati.  
\v 19 Ipi bolla Pakai thupeh nanit louham? Ipi jeh pentah a thil nachom’a Pakai mitmua thilse nabol ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Saul’in, “Ahinlah Pakai thupeh kabol'e, bollin tia eisol na kagabol'e. Agag lengpa bou ahing’a kahin kai ahin, ahin adangse vang kahin that gamnai,” ati nalaiyin ahi.  
\v 21 Chutengleh ka sepai ten, kelngoi, kelcha, bongchal, athaolai ahoilai ho leh thil kichom ho hi Gilgal’a na Pathen houna a dinga ahin kaiyu ahi bouve,” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Ahin Samuel'in adonbut in,  
\b  
\q1 “Pakai chu pumgo thilto kibol le  
\q2 athupeh ngaipeh hi hoijoh a hi  
\q2 kipah inte natim?  
\q1 Ngaijin! Sei ngai kiti hi gan'a kilhai sanga phajo ahin,  
\q2 kangcha athusei ngaipeh kiti hi kelngoichal thao sang’a phajo ahi.   
\q1
\v 23 Pakai doumah kibol kiti hi kithoi phunsan tobang ahin,  
\q2 chule louchal kiti hi doi houva themmo chan tobang ahi.  
\q1 Pakai thupeh napai jeh a  
\q2 Aman leng nahina a konna napai ahitai,” ati.   
\s1 Saul In Ngaidam Athum  
\p
\v 24 Saul in, “Henge, keima ka chonse tai, keiman neihilna ho jong kangai pon chule Pakai thupeh jong kanit tapoi, ka sepai te kagin jeh a athil thum hou ka bolpeh ahitai,” ati.  
\v 25 “Hijeh chun ka chonsetna ho hi nei ngaidam inlang chule Pathen kahou theina din nei kinung lhonpin,” ati.   
\p
\v 26 Ahinlah Samuel in adonbut in, “Keitoh ikinung lhon theilou ding ahi! Pakai thupeh na paimang jeh a, aman Israel te lenga konna na paidoh ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 27 Hichun Samuel chemang dinga akiheiya ahile, aman asangkhol chol mong chun aman in aloi ehlo tan ahi. \x + \xo 15:27 \xt 1 Samuel 28:17; 1 Lgt 11:30,31\x*  
\v 28 Chuin Samuel in ajah ah, “Tunia hi Pakaijin Israel te lenggam chu nanga konna na lahpeh a nang sanga phajo khat apehdoh ahitai.  
\v 29 Israel Pathen lal loupi tah chu jou louding, alung jong akhel louding ahi, ajeh chu ama lungkhel ding mihem tobang ahipoi!” ati.   
\p
\v 30 Hichun Saul’in ngaidam athum kit in, “Chonse kahi, keiman kakihet e, ahin nei lungset in, ka lamkai ho masang le kami Israel mite masanga kajum louna din nei kilhonpi tei teijin, chutile Pakai na Pathen kahou ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 31 Hichun Samuel jong achaina in kinung lhonpi ding anomtai chule Pathen houna ah ajaotai.   
\s1 Samuel In Agag Lengpa Atha  
\p
\v 32 Chuin Samuel in, “Agag lengpa chu kaheng’a hinpuijun,” ati. Agag lengpa jong kinemtah in akipah lheh in ahi, ajeh chu ama lunggel’a chu, “kagimna ho kichaiya, eikilhadoh ding ahitai!” tia agel ahi.  
\v 33 Ahinlah Samuel in, “Na chemjam’a hin minu acha pasal tamtah na-na that in, tun nanu jong hitobanga chun chaneilou hitahen,” atin ahi. Chuin Samuel in Agag chu Pakai masang'ah Gilgal mun'ah asatchen chen tan ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Chuin Samuel Ramah a ainlam ajonin chule Saul jong Gibeah a ain’ah akile tai.  
\v 35 Chujou kalsen Samuel in Saul kimupin ache ngai tapoi, ahinlah tang louvin alunghempi jingin ahi. Pakaijin Saul Israel te lenga anatun chu akisih lheh jenge.   
\c 16  
\s1 Samuel In David Leng Dia Thao Anu  
\p
\v 1 Tun Pakaijin Samuel kom'a, “Nangman phat sottah Saul chung changa pul nadou chu phaset tante, keiman ama chu Israel te leng ahina a konna ka paidoh ahitai, hijeh chun na thao theiyah olive thao kithun dim inlang Bethlehem’ah chetan. Hiche khopia cheng amin Jesse kitipa chu holdoh in, ajeh chu keiman achate lah a khat chu leng dinga ka lhendohsa ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 2 Ahin Samuel in adongin, “Keiman hichu iti kabol thei ding ham? Hichepi chu Saul in jadoh henlang hileh eithalo ding ahi,” ati.  
\p Pakaijin adonbut in, “Bong ala khat kikai inlang chen, chule Pakaiya dinga gan kilhaina a dinga hung kahi tin,” ati.  
\v 3 “Chule gan kilhaina ah Jesse kouvin, chuteng keiman achate lah a koipen chu kei dinga thao nanu ding ham ti chu na hetsah nange,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Chuin Samuel in Pakaijin ahil bang chun aboltai. Ama Bethlehem alhun phat chun, khopi sunga um upaho jouse chun kitihot pum-pum’in akimupi uvin, “Ipi adihlou um ham? Chamna puma nahungu hinam?” tin ana dongun ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun Samuel in, “Henge, keima gan kilhaina a dinga hunga kahi, na boncha uvin Pakaiya dingin kisutheng unlang gankilhaina a dingin cheu hite,” tin Samuel in adonbut in ahi. Chuin Samuel in Jesse le achate akou khom’in kisuhthengna kin agong’in, chule pumgo thilto a jong jao diuvin atem'un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Chuin amaho chu ahunglhun phat un, aman Eliab chu khatvei aven chule alungthim'ah, “Pakaijin alhendohpa hitei yinte!” tin agel’e.   
\p
\v 7 Ahinlah Pakaijin Samuel kom'a aseijin, “Nangman atahsa poh ahilou le asandan chun vehih-in, ajeh chu keiman ama chu kadei lou ahi, ijeh inem itileh Pakaijin mihem thilvet banga avet ahipoi, ajeh chu mihem’in apolam melput avet ahin, Pakaijin vang alungsung avet ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Chuin Jesse in achapa Abinadab chun Samuel anaijep a amasang’a ding din asol'in ahinlah Samuel in, “Ama jong hi Pakai lhendohsa chu ahipoi,” ati.  
\v 9 Aban’in Jesse in Shimea ahin koudoh in, ahinlah Samuel in, “Ama jong hi Pakaijin alhendoh chu ahipoi,” ati.  
\v 10 Chuti chun Jesse chate sagi jen chu Samuel angsung’ah ahin puilut un, ahin Samuel in Jesse adongin, “Pakaijin hiche ho hi khatcha alhengpoi,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin Samuel in Jesse jah a, “Na chate hicheng bou hi hitam?” tia adoh leh,  
\p Jesse'n adonbut in, “Aneopen pa aum nalaiye, ahinlah ama hi in’ah aumpoi, loujaova kelngoi le kelcha ho aching’e,” tin adonbut in ahile  
\p Samuel in, “Ama chu gakou sah un, ama chu ahung lhun tokah a, toujong itoulou diu chule anneh twidon jong ibollou diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Hiti chun Jesse in akou ding mi asol'in ahi. Ama chu mi tahsa phatah chule amit-ha hoitah ahi. Chuin Pakaijin, “Thao nu ding chu ama hi ahi,” ati.  
\v 13 David asopi teho lah a kon'in ahung ding doh in, hichun Samuel’in olive thao alan thao chu anu tai. Hiche nia kipan chun Pakai Lhagao chu thaneitah in David chung’ah ahung chutan ahi. Chuin Samuel Ramah ah akile tai.   
\s1 David In Saul Thutanna a Na Atoh  
\p
\v 14 Hiti chun Pakai lhagaovin Saul adalha tan ahi, chule Pakaijin ahinsol lhagao engse khat in Saul chu lunggimna le tijatnan abolgim lheh jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Saul asohte ho lah a phabep khat in akom'ah, “Tua hi Pathen a konna lhagao gilou khat in na suhgim ahi kaheuve,” atiuve.  
\v 16 “Hijeh chun, kapu, neisol’unlang semjang saithem khat gahol unge. Hitia lhagao engsen nahin phah phat-phat le ama chun semjang saiyin tin, chuteng damdoh kitji tan nate,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 17 Hichun Saul in, “Apha lheh jenge, cheuvin lang semjang saithem tah mikhat gahol unlang, chule ama chu kaheng'a hin puijun,” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Chuin asohte ho lah a mi khat in Saul jah ah, “Jesse chapa teho lah a khat, Bethlehem mi, semjang saithem tah, hiche goh chu hilouva mihangsan, gal-hat, galbolmi, ijakai hekhen themtah, chule mel-hoitah, chujongleh Pakaijin aumpi mi ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Chuin Saul in thupolea mikhat Jesse henga thulhut ding’in asol'in, “Na chapa David kelngoiching chu neihin solpeh in,” ati.  
\v 20 Saul in David athum chu Jesse in anoppeh in, changlhah toh, lengpitwi haikhat, chule kelnou khat, sangan khat apohsah in ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Chuin David Saul kom’ah achen, Saul chu ajen pan tan ahi, Saul in David angailu lheh jengin chule David chu Saul galvon pon apang tai.   
\p
\v 22 Chuin Saul in Jesse kom'a thu athot in, “Lungset tah in David hi kakom'ah kakin bol in pang jeng tahen, ajeh chu achung’a kalung alhai lheh jengin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Chule Pathen'in ahinsol lhagao engse chun Saul ahin phah tengleh, David in semjang chu asaipeh jiteng, Saul chu ahung limdohjin chule lhagao engse chun adalhaji in ahi.   
\c 17  
\s1 Goliath In Israel te Achou  
\p
\v 1 Judah gamsung Socoh mun'a chun Philistine mite galsat dingin akikhom’un, chule Socoh le Azekah kikah’a Ephes-dammim achun ngahmun asem tauvin ahi.  
\v 2 Chuin Saul le Israel te jong akikhom’un, Philistine te dounan Elah phaicham panga ngahmun akisem’un ahi.  
\v 3 Philistine te chu lhaangkhat ah akigol’un chule Israel te jong chu lhaangkhat ah akigol’un chule akikah uva phaicham khat in akhen un ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Chule Philistine te mihat tah Gath khopia konna hungkon, amin Goliath kitipa chun Israel te sat dingin Philistine te ngahmun a kon'in ahung potdoh in ahi. Ama chu feet 9 val jenin asangin ahi!  
\v 5 Chule aman sum-eng lukhuh akhuh in, sum-eng a kisem ompho pounds 125 a gih aki-ah in ahi.  
\v 6 Akeng teni jong sum-eng’a kitomjol ahin, chule alengkouva ama sum-eng tengcha akipoh chu kitungdoh peh ahi.  
\v 7 Atengcha long chu tumbi tejen ahin, atengpeh jong thih jeng agihdan chu pound 15 a gih ahin, apho chu mikhat poh ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Goliath a dingin Israel galsat miho jah a ahin samin, “Ipi dinga galsat dinga hung kigola nahiuvem, keima Philistine mihatpa kahin, nangho Saul sohte mai-mai nahiuve, ei kisatpi ding mikhat hung kilheng doh un,” atin ahi.  
\v 9 “Aman keima eitha le nasoh u kahi diu, ken ama katha le keiho soh nahi diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 10 “Tunia hi Israel galsat ho kachou nahiuve, kakisatpi ding pa chu hin soldoh un,” ati.  
\v 11 Chuin Saul le Israel mite jousen Plilistine mipa thusei ajah phat un, akicha lheh jeng tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Jesse In Saul Ngahmun’a David Asol  
\p
\v 12 David kitipa chu Judah gam Bethlehem khopia Ephrah mi Jesse chapa ahin, hiche lai chun Jesse chu ateh lheh jeng tan chule aman chapa get jen aneijin ahi.  
\v 13 Jesse chapa alen thum Eliab, Abinadab, chule Shimea ho chu Philistine te sat dia Saul lengpa sepai a pang ahiuve.  
\v 14 David chu achate lah a aneopen ahi. David ute thum ho chu Saul sepaiho toh umkhom’a ahiuve.  
\v 15 Ahin David chu Saul inpia konna apa kelngoi chin kithopi dia Bethlehem a hung kile kitji ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Ni somli sungin jingkah, nilhah seh leh Philitine mihat pan Israel sepai ho ahin naiyin achou jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Nikhat Jesse in David jah ah, “Hiche pucha a chang kanpoh hile changlhah lhon som hi choijin lang gangtah in na ute gapen.  
\v 18 Chule hiche bongnoiha a kisem lhon som hi sepaiho lamkaipa pen. Na ute iti nauvem gaven lang, thu nahin nungpoh kit ding ahi,” tin ana sollin ahi.  
\v 19 David ute ho chu Saul to umkhom'a ahiuvin, Israel sepaiho chu Elah phaichama gal mun’a um ahiuve.   
\p
\v 20 Chuin David in akelngoiho chu avetup din mi khat angansen, jingkah matah in apan athupeh bangin thil ho chu apon, achen ahile sepaiho galsat dinga ngahmun dalha dinga akigot uva a-ao laitah un ngahmun chu agalhungin ahi.  
\v 21 Israel te le Philistine sepaiho gal kisat dia kidinte-a kimaitoa akigol laitah un,  
\v 22 David in thilkeo chingtup pa henga athilpoh ho chu adalhan, gangtah in a-ute ho chibai agabol tai.  
\v 23 Aman a uteho akihoulimpi laitah in, Gath mi Philistine mihatpa chu Philistine sepai ho lah a kon'in ahung potdoh in ana seingaiji bangin asamin, Israel mite chu ahin choukit tan ahile, hichu David in ajatan ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Chuin Israel sepai ten hiche mipa chu amu phat un akicha behseh jengun ajam tauvin ahi.  
\v 25 Hichun alah uva mikhat in David jah a, “Hiche mihatpa chu namu em? Aniseh leh hitia khu hung potdoh a Israel sepai te achou-chou ji ahi, koi hileh ama thatpen pen khu lengpan kipaman lentah apeh ding, achanu khat jong aji ding’a apeh ding, chule Israel ten kai peh dingdol a kon'a jong a onthol sah ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 26 David in akimvel'a ding Israel sepai ho jah ah, “Hiche cheptanlou Philistine mahatpa that a, Israel mite achouna ngahsah mi chun ipi amu ding ham? Ipi hile iti hiche cheptanlou Philistine pan hingjing Pathen sepai te ajumso ding ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 27 Chuin miho chun adonbut un, “Henge hiche mipa that pen-pen chu kipaman akisei chu peh ding ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 28 Ahinlah David ute ho lah a alenpen Eliab chun David thusei ajahdoh phat in alung ahang in, “Hichea hi ipi nahung bolle ham? Na kelngoi hon ho chu ipi itihen nati ham? Nakiletsahna le na jonchih na chu kahe nai, hichea kidouna ho venom mai maija hunga nahi bouve!” ati.   
\p
\v 29 Hichun David in, “Ken tua chu ipi kabol em? Thudoh kagah nei mai-mai ahi,” tin adonbut in ahi.  
\v 30 Chuin amahoa kon'in adang ho langah akihei kit in athudoh ma-ma adoh a ahile, ama hon jong asei ma-ma aseikit un ahi.  
\v 31 David thudoh chu Saul lengpa kom agalhut un ahile Saul lengpan jong aheng’a ahin pui diuvin thu apetan ahi.   
\s1 David In Goliath Atha  
\p
\v 32 “Hiche Philistine mipa chunga khun boi tahih un, kache ding kaga kimaitopi ding ahi,” tin David in Saul jah a aseijin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Saul in, “Angol nahim! Nangman hiche Philistine mihatpa nasat a najona ding lampi aum theipoi, nangma chapang cha bou nahin, ama akhangdon laiya kipatna galsat mi ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 34 Ahinlah David in, “Kapa kelngoi ho leh kelcha ho jong kana vetkol ahin, nasohpa hin kapa kelngoi kana chinna a chun keipi bahkai le vompi ahunga kelnou ho ahung lhohmang ding got tengleh,  
\v 35 anung kadellin, kakidalpin, akamsung’a kon'in ka huhdoh jin ahi, chule keima tha dia eigot tengleh akha ah kaman in kathat jitai.  
\v 36 Keipi le vompi ani nia hitia chu kabolji ahin chule tua jong Philistine chep tanlou pa jong chutia chu kabol ding ahi, ajeh chu aman hingjing Pathen sepai ho ajumso jeh a hitia chu bol ding ahi.  
\v 37 Pakai keipi bahkai le vompi khutphanga konna eihuhdoh pa chun tunia jong hiche Philistine mihatpa a konna eihuhdoh tei ding ahi, ” atin boltei agoi.  
\p Hichun Saul in achaina in lunggel lhahna aneijin, “Aphai nakigot bang chun boltan chule Pakaijin naumpi jing tahen,” ati.   
\p
\v 38 Chuin Saul in agalvon David apen, alukhuh sum-eng a kisem akhuhpeh in, thih sangkhol a-ahpeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Hichun David in agalvon chunga chun achemjam akoijin, kal khat agah son le galvon ho akivon khahlou jeh in, achethei tapon ahi. Hijeh chun aman Saul jah a,  
\p “Hiche ho pumin chethei ponge, ajeh chu hiche ho hi kamang theipoi,” atin, asut lhatai.  
\v 40 Hichun David in vadung songchang jolsel chang nga akilopan, akelngoi chinna sakhao neovah akikon, chuin akelngoi chinna tenggol le sailungchang kapna gophel akichoijin, Philistine mihatpa umna phaicham ajontai.   
\p
\v 41 Goliath jong ahung potdoh in David lam ahin jontai chule agalvon popa chu ahung masan ahi.  
\v 42 Goliath in David chu phatah a avettoh phat in, chapang mel-hoi cha bou ahinah laijeh in, asit behseh jeh in alung ahang tai.  
\v 43 David jah a lunghang tah in, “Keima uicha kahia mol kichoija kaheng'a hung nahim?” ati. Hichun Philistine mipa chun, apathen ho min pan in David chu agaosap tai.  
\v 44 Goliath in David chu achouvin, “Hilam ah hungin, keiman natahsa chu vachate le gamsa te kapeh ding ahi,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 45 David in Philistine mipa chu adonbut in, “Nangma chemjam le tengcha choiya hung nahin, ahinlah keima vang van gam sepai galsat te Pakai min'a hung kahi.  
\v 46 Tunia hi Pakaijin najo ding, keiman nang katha a nalu katan ding, natahsa thisa chu vachate le gamsate kapeh ding chule leiset pumpin Israel Pathen khat aum'e ti ahet diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 47 “Chule hichea hung kikhom jousen Pakaijin chemjam le tengchan ahuhhingpoi ti ahet dingu ahi. Ajeh chu galsat hi Pakaiya ahin, aman nangho kakhut a eipehdoh diu ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 48 Goliath ahung kipatdoh a David henglam ahin jot phat in, David chu kintah in Philistine mihatpa toh kisuto dingin alhaisuh tan ahi.  
\v 49 David in akhut in asakhao sung asoh in, song chang khat aladoh in, ah-songse’a chu asea ahile, Philistine mipa chalpang ah achun, songchang chu alut in, Goliath tol-lhang'ah alhutan ahi.   
\p
\v 50 Chuti chun David in chemjam pang louhellin, songchang khat seh le ah-songse in Goliath ajoutan ahi. \x + \xo 17:50 \xt 2 Samuel 21:19\x*  
\v 51 Chuin David in adellut paiyin, Goliath chemjam chu asatdoh in, ama chemjam ma-ma chun alol atan tan ahi.  
\s1 Israel ten Philistine Mite Adelkhum’u  
\m Chuin Philistine mipi ten amihat pau thi amu phat un, akinung heijun ajam tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 17:51 \xt 2 Samuel 21:19\x*   
\p
\v 52 Chuin Israel te le Judah miho akipat un, a-aovun, phaicham le Ekron kotpi aphah kah seuvin Philistine mite nung adel’un ahi. Chule Philistine mipi ho chu Shaaraim lam lhong lhungin thilong akijam thang’un, Gath le Ekron chan geijin athilong u chu alum thang sohkei jengin ahi.  
\v 53 Chuin Israel chaten Philistine mite anungdel uva kon'in ahung kinung leuvin, angahmun hou chu asumang’un achom tauvin ahi.  
\v 54 Chuin David in Philistine mihatpa luchang chu alan Jerusalem ah ahin potai; ahin galvon vang apon in’ah akoitai.   
\p
\v 55 David Philistine pa sat dinga akondoh chun Saul in agalvon popa Abner jah ah, “Hiche gollhang pa khu koi cha ham? tin adongin ahile  
\p Abner in jong, “Atahbah in kahepoi,” tin ana donbut e.   
\p
\v 56 Hichun lengpan jong, “Aphai, koiham hinkhol chen’in,” ati.   
\p
\v 57 David in Goliath ahin tha jouva ahung lhun in, Abner in Philistine mihatpa luchang chu Saul kom'ah ahin lhut tan ahi.  
\v 58 Hichun Saul in, “Gollhang, napa koiham nei seipeh in,” atin ahile  
\p David in adonbut in, “Kapa min Jesse ahin, Bethlehem a um kahiuve,” ati.   
\c 18  
\s1 Saul David Chung’a Athangthip  
\p
\v 1 David in Saul akihoupi jouvin, lengpa chapa Jonathan toh akimuton, Jonathan in David angailut jeh chun, akikah lhona kintah a kitepna khat semdin akigong lhon tan ahi.  
\v 2 Hichenia kipat chun Saul in David akom'ah akikoi jing tan ainlam'ah akilesah kit tapon ahi.  
\v 3 Jonathan in David chu adei behseh jeh le ama akingailut banga angailut jeh in a-itih a kikhenpi lou dingin akikah lhon'ah kihahselna khat asemin ahi.  
\v 4 Jonathan in hiche akihahselna melchih nan, achunga kai asangkhol chol chu asut lhan asilpeh in, chule avonho, achemjam le athalpi chule akonggah geiyin David apetan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Chuti chun Saul in David chu asolna lam lam'ah achejin alolhing sohkeiyin ahi. Hijeh chun Saul in asepaiho chunga gallamkai dingin atungin ahile, mijouse jong achung ah akipah cheh un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Israel miten galjona ahin nei jouvun inlama ahung kile kit un, David in Philistine te ahintha jouvun, khopi jousea nupiho ahung potdoh un, Saul lengpa ahung kimupi uvin ahi, numei hon khongcha le tumging thei toh thon kipahtah in lam pumin la asauvin ahi.  
\v 7 Vailhun na a alasah u chu hiche ahi:  
\b  
\q1 “Saul in asang asangin athat in,  
\q2 David in asangsom asangsom in athat e!” tin alachoiyun ahi. \x + \xo 18:7 \xt 1 Samuel 21:11; 29:5\x*   
\b  
\p
\v 8 Hiche chun Saul nasatah in alunghan sah in, “Hiche hi ipi ham? Ama hon David achoisangun, sangsom athat e atiuvin, kei sangkhat that in eiseijun. Abankit tengleh lengin hin kitun kit taveh tau!” atin ahi.  
\v 9 Hijeh chun, hichenia kipat chun, Saul in David chu thangthipna mitvet in avepan tan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ajing nikho ma-man Pathen a kon'in lhagao phalou Saul chungah ahung chukit in, insunga angol pen bangin apengin ahile, David in nidanga bangin, akhut in semjang asaijin ahi. Ahin Saul in akhut ah tengcha akichoijin ahi.  
\v 11 Chule hetman louvin, tengchan David chu akhon ahi, bangtoh khobeh ding agot ahin, ahinlah David in ana otdoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Pathen'in Saul adalhah a David aumpi jeh chun Saul in Daivd chu akicha lheh jeng tan ahi.  
\v 13 Hijeh chun Saul in, David chu sepai 1,000 chung’a lamkai dingin akoiyin gamla tah in asolmang tan ahi. David in jong kitup tah in alamkaijin gal akonpi in ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin David Pakaijin aumpi jeh chun imalam jouse’ah alolhing lheh jengin ahi.  
\v 15 David lolhinna thu ho Saul in ajahdoh kit phat in, akicha cheh-cheh jeng tan ahi.  
\v 16 David in nasatah a, kituptah a gal alamkai jeh in, Israel te jouse le Judah nam mite jousen jong David chu angailu un, akipapi lheh jengun ahi.   
\s1 David In Saul Chanu Akichenpi  
\p
\v 17 Nikhat hi Saul in David kom'ah, “Ka chanu alenjo nu Merab khu naji dia pedinga kigongsa kahi. Ahinlah amasan nangma Pakaiya dinga gal hang mong nahi photchenna neipen,” ati. Ajeh chu Saul’in alunggel a, “Keima tah in katha sangin, Philistine tetoh kidou dingin kisol henlang hin that doh uleh,” tia angaito ahi.   
\p
\v 18 David in, “Kei koi kahiya chule ka insung mite hi Israel a ipi hiya, keima lengpa tupa kahi ding ham? Chule kapa insung mite jong ima ahipoi” ati.  
\v 19 Hijeh chun, Merab toh akichenna ding phat ahung lhun phat in, Saul in, Adriel kiti Meholah mipi toh Merab chu akichen sah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Ahinlah Saul chanu Michal chun David chu alungset in, hichu Saul in ajahdoh phat in akipah lheh jengin ahi.  
\v 21 Hichun Saul in alunggel in, “Hiche Philistine te khutna athina dinga phat kijen chomkhat ahi,” atin ahinlah Saul anivei nan David kom'a chun, “Katupa nahi tei ding ahitai!” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Saul in avaipote kom'a chun, David jah a asei diu thu apen, “Lengpan nadei lheh jenge, chule keihon jong pha kasa lheh jeng uve, hijeh chun lengpa tupa nahi ding pha nasah louham?” tia aseipeh din ahil’e.   
\p
\v 23 Saul avaipo ten hiche thu ho chu David kom'a aseijun ahile, David in, “Kei mivaicha, insung lhasam le mi nahsahmo, lengpa tupa a iti kapan thei ding ham?” tin ana donbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Chuin Saul mite hon hiche thu chu Saul kom'a aseidoh phat un,  
\v 25 Saul in David kom'a asei diu ahil kit in, “Lengpan mou lahman dia adei chu ahile amelmate chunga phulahna dinga Philistine te chep 100 tilou adang imacha angeh poi tin seipeh un,” ati. Ahinla Saul chun David chu Philisine te khut a thisah tei agot ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Saul lengpa thil ngeh chu David in ajahdoh phat in kipahtah in asangtai, anikho kitep alhun masang'in,  
\v 27 David ama le amite akipatdoh un, Philistine te mi jani aga that un ahi. Hiti chun David in lengpan angaichat chu asuh bulhit peh in, chep kitan chu aga petan ahi. Chuin Saul in achanu Michal chu David ji dingin apetan ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Pakaijin David aumpi ti kichen tah in ahetan, chule achanu Michal angailut dan ahetan ahi.  
\v 29 Saul in David chu aging cheh-cheh jengtan, hijeh chun Saul chu ahinkho lhumkeiyin David din amelma ahijom jing jengtai.   
\p
\v 30 Philistine sepai ten aphatseh leh ahin nokhum jing jengun, ahin David hatna achang jing jengin, David min nasatah in akithang tan ahi.   
\c 19  
\s1 Saul In David Tha Ding Agot  
\p
\v 1 Saul in achapa Jonathan le asohte ho jouse toh David thana ding lunggel anei khompi tan ahi. Ahinlah Jonathan le David gol phatah ahi lhon jeh chun,  
\v 2 Jonathan in David jah a, “Kapan, jing jingkah le tha ding nagoi, chingtheiyin, loulai sunga kiselna ding mun khat kihol’in,” tin apa thilgon ho jouse chu aseipeh tan ahi.  
\v 3 “Chutengleh, keiman kapa chu munchom khatna puidoh ing kating, nachung chang thu kihoulimpi ing katin, kamudoh chengse chu nang ka seipeh ding nahi,” tin aseipeh kittan ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Ajing jingkah in, Jonathan in David chung chang thu apa kom'ah aphatna le athilpha bol jeng aseipeh in ahi. Chule Jonathan in apa kom'a chun, “Lengpa chu asoh David douna a chonse louding ahi chule David in nangma dounan thil imacha abolpoi, aman ajochanin aphat jousen nakithopin ahi,” ati.  
\v 5 “Pathen thahatna jal'a Philistine mihatpa ana tha a Israel te dinga gal lentah eina jopeh u phatlai chu nasuhmil hitam? Hichea thilsoh chung changa chu nangma na-na kipa dehset hilou ham? Achutia ahileh imacha bolselou, mona neilou David chu ipi bolla tha ding nagot ham? Ajeh imacha aumpoi!” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Hijeh chun Saul in Jonathan thusei chu phatah in angaijin chuin akihahsel’in, “Hingjing Pakai min pan’a kasei ahi, David chu kithat louding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hiche jou chun Jonathan in David akouvin, thil ijakai aseipeh tan ahi. Chule aman David chu Saul kom'ah apuijin, amasa bangin David in leng inpi’ah na atong kit in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Chuin Philistine tetoh gal kisatna aumkit in, David in asepai te akipuijin Philistine tetoh akisat in, amaho nasatah in athat in ahile, amaho ajam tauve.   
\p
\v 9 Ahinlah nikhat hi Saul in’ah atouvin tengcha akhut ah akichoijin ahile, Pathen a konna hungkon lhagao dihlou chu hetman louvin achungah ahung chukit in ahile, David in angai bangin semjang asai laitah in,  
\v 10 Saul in David chu atengcha choiya chun akhon, bangtoh khobeh ding agotna ahile, David in ana otdoh in, atengcha chu bang ah akibut lut jengin, hiche jan chun David akiseldoh tan ahi.   
\s1 Michal In Daivd Hinkho Ahuhdoh  
\p
\v 11 Chuin Saul in David ain langa avelhi dingin asepai te asol'in ahi. Asepai te jah ah, ajing jingkah teng ain a konna ahung potdoh tengleh natha dingu ahi, tin thu apen ahi. Ahinlah a inneipi Michal in David jah a, “Tujana nakiseldoh louva ahileh, jing jingkah leh nathi ding ahitai,” ati. \x + \xo 19:11 \xt Labu 59\x*  
\v 12 Chuin a inneipi Michal in kotcha neo langa kon'in akhai lhan, ajamdoh in, ahoidoh tai.  
\v 13 Hichun amanun milim khat alan, alupna ah ponsa khat asil peh’in, asam dingin kelcha mul asempeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin sottol le ho ahung uva David mat ding agot uleh, a inneipin adam hih in athou joupoi tin alep in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Ahinlah Saul in asottolle ho jah a thu apen, “Alupna a kon'in hin kaidoh un, katha ding ahi,” atin ahi.  
\v 16 Ahin alupna a konna kaidoh ding agot uva aponsil chu agah hodoh uva ahileh, milim kisemthu, alua kelchamul chu amudoh tauve.   
\p
\v 17 Hijeh chun Saul in Michal jah a, “Ipi bolla hitia hi nei joulhep a, kagalmi keija konna na jamdoh sah ham?” atin ahile,  
\p Michal in jong, “Aman nei kithopi louva ahileh katha ding nahi eiti jeh a kabol ahi,” tin ana donbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 David ajamdoh in Ramah khopi ah achen Samuel to akimuto in, chule Saul in achunga itobang tah a na atoh ham ti aseipeh tan ahi. Samuel in David akilhonpin Ramah gamsunga Naioth mun’ah acheng tan ahi.  
\v 19 David Ramah gamsunga Naioth mun'a aum'e ti thulhut Saul’in ana jatan ahi.  
\v 20 Hichun aman David man dingin sottolle ho asoltan ahi. Ahinlah amaho agalhun phat un, Samuel lamkaina a themgao phabep in gaothu asei pet u atohkha uvin, Saul sottolle ho chu Pathen Lhagao achung uvah ahung chun, ama hon jong gaothu aseipan tauvin ahi.  
\v 21 Chuin Saul in hichu ajahdoh kit phat in, sottol dang ho asolkit in ahileh, ama hon jong gaothu aseiden kit tauvin ahi. Athumvei chan nan jong angai-ngai ahiuve.  
\v 22 Chuphat in, Saul ama tah Ramah kho jonin achetai, Secu a um twikul lentah phung ahin phah in, “Samuel le David hoiya um lhon em?” tin adongin ahile,  
\p “Ramah gam'a Naioth mun ah aum lhon'e,” tin mi koiham khat in ahin donbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Ahin Ramah gam'a Naioth ajot chun, lampi ah Pathen Lhagao Saul chungah ahung chun, Naioth alhun kahsen gaothu aseijin ahi.  
\v 24 Saul in apon abotkeh in, akeochang in tollhang ah alumin, Samuel angsung’ah sun nilhum jan khovah in gaothu asei in ahi. Chuin mihon aveuvin, adatmo uvin, “Iti dana, Saul jeng jong themgao lah a jao hitam?” atiuvin ahi. \x + \xo 19:24 \xt 1 Samuel 10:11,12\x*   
\c 20  
\s1 Jonathan In David Akithopi  
\p
\v 1 David chu Ramah gam'a Naioth a kon'in ajamdoh’in, Jonathan kom ajonin, “Ipi kabol’a, ipi kabol khel hitam? Itobang gitlouna ipi um’a napan tha dinga eihol le-le ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 2 Jonathan in, “Hichu dihlou ahi, nangma thipon nate, abol ding jouse thilneo hihen lang thil len hijongleh kei hetlouvin ima abolji poi, eihetsah jinai. Kapan hitobang thil ho hi kakom'a aselguh louhel ding ahi,” tin ana nelkal in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Chuin David chu Jonathan masang'ah akihahsel'in, “Napan iki golngai lhon hi kichentah a ahet sohkei ahi, hijeh chun ama le ama akihouvin, Jonathan hetsah da tange, ipi bolla alung kasuhnat ding ham? Ahinlah hingjing Pakai le nangma min pan a kasei ahi keima le thina kikah hi kal khat seh bou uma ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Jonathan in, “Ipi ti kakithopi thei ding ham nei seipeh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 David in adonbut in, “Jing nikho hi lhathah kut ahin, lengpa to ankong umkhom dingdol kahi, ahin keima jing nikho tengleh loulaiya kakisel'a hichea chu nithum channa nilhah tokah a kaum den ding ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 20:5 \xt Minbu 28:11\x*  
\v 6 “Napan hoiya che ham tia nahin doh a ahileh, Bethlehem ain’ah kumseh kilhaina bol dingin kakom'ah phalna athum’in ache e tin seipeh in,” ati.  
\v 7 “Aman ‘Aphai!’ atia ahileh, thu anom'e ti nahet ding ahi. Ahinlah alung ahanna alung alhaso khah a ahile, eithanom ahi ti nahet ding ahi.  
\v 8 Lungset tah in hiti chun nei bolpeh in, thengsel’a kaheng'a Pakai ang’a nakitepna nit in. amavang napa douna a themmo kahile nangma tah in nei that jengin. Ahinlah nei joulhep hihbeh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Jonathan in, “Hitobang chu agel in geldan, kapan chutobang’a nangma thana ding lunggel neocha hijongleh anei mong’a ahile, nang kahin mahetsah tei ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Chuin David in, “Napa alunghang’e ahilou le alunghang poi tichu ken iti kahet thei ding ham?” tin adongin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Jonathan in adonbut in, “Hungin loulai langa khun gapotdoh hite,” ati. Chule polam’ah akijotdoh khom lhon'in ahi.  
\v 12 Chuti chun Jonathan in David kom'ah, “Pakai Israel Pathen chu a hetoh hijeng hen! Keiman jing tuphat don ahilouleh nithum jou tengleh, kapa donging katin, na chunga alungdam nah le thu kahin thot ding ahi.  
\v 13 Ahinlah ijem tia kapa alunghan’a nangma tha tei ding nagot a, nangma na hindoh tei-teina dinga keiman nahenga ka seipeh masat a kasolmang lou pou-pouva ahileh Pakaijin Jonathan kiti keima hi eibolsejo hen ahilou jongleh eithat jeng hen. Pakaijin kapa ana umpi bangin nang jong naumpi hen,” ati.  
\v 14 “Nei ngailut monga ahileh, ka hinkho aumlai sungsen Pakai ngailutna sangtah in nei ngailun. Ahinlah kathia ahileh,  
\v 15 ka insung mite din tahsan umtah ngailutna sangtah in hin ngailun chule Pakaijin nagal mite jouse jong leiset a kon'in sumang gamkei hen,” ati. \x + \xo 20:15 \xt 2 Samuel 9:1\x*   
\p
\v 16 Hijeh chun Jonathan in David toh kitepna khat asemin, “Pakaijin nagal mite jouse sugamkei hen!” ati.  
\v 17 Chule Jonathan in David chu ama aki ngailut bang banga angailut jeh chun, David in jong angailut din akitepsah kittan ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Chuin Jonathan in, “Jing nikho le lhathah kut kimang ding ahin, natouna dokhang a-on jeh a nakiholmo ding ahi.  
\v 19 Athaini nilhah lam leh, tumasanga nakiselji na mun songpi pang ma-ma achun che inlang gakisel tan.  
\v 20 Chule keima kahungdoh a doikhat nei banga thalchang thum hiche panga chu kahin kap ding ahi.  
\v 21 Chule chapang khat thal chang ho hol ding’a kahinsol ding ahi. Chule chapangpa jah a, ‘Ven, thalchang ho chu nasihlam panga aum'e,’ tia kasei najah a ahile, hingjing Pakai min'a kasei ahi, abonchan apha sohkeiye, imacha hahsatna aumpoi.  
\v 22 Amavang keiman ama jah a, 'Gamla jepmah chen, thal chang chu nakhel lamah aum'e, katia ahile, nalampia gangtah in che jengin, ajeh chu Pakaijin na solmang ahi, ti hetna ahi,' ati.  
\v 23 Chule Pakai ahettohsah ahijeh in, ikitepna vang chu Pakaijin tonsot geiya einit sah tei-tei lhon hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 24 Hiti chun David chu loulaiyah akisellin, chule lhathah kut kimanna ahunglhun phat in, Lengpa chu, anne dingin atoulha tan ahi.  
\v 25 Chule lengpa chu nidanga bangin bang kom'a touna chunga chun atouvin ahi. Jonathan toh akimai ngatton, chule Abner asih-lang ah atouve. Ahin David touna chu a ongtai.  
\v 26 Ahinlah Saul in hiche ni chun imacha aseipoi, ajeh chu ama chunga thil thenglou khat touvin David asuhboh hinte, tia lung agel ahi.  
\v 27 Ahinlah, ajinga jong David touna a-on kit phat in, Saul in Jonathan jah a, “Ipi jeh a Jesse chapa janhia jong tunia jong hunglou hitam?” tin adongtai.   
\p
\v 28 Jonathan in, “David in Bethlehem a che dingin hatah in kakom'a phalna athumin ahi.  
\v 29 Aman, ‘Lungset tah in, nei chesah in, ajeh chu ka insung miten kumseh a khosunga gan kilhaina kanei jiu ahin, chule kasopi te ho jong kakimupi nom’e, tin ataovin ahi.' Hijeh a chu lengpa dokhang’a atouna ong’ah ahi,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Chuin Jonathan chunga Saul alunghang behseh jengin, “Numei chaveinu chapa!” tin lunghang tah in ahousen ahi. “Nalunggel ho hi ken kahet louva nagel ham? Na khella lenga natun got ham? Nangma le nanu jumso pa,” ati.  
\v 31 “Jesse chapa David ahinlai sungsen, nang leng’in pang thei pon nate. Tun chenlang gaholdoh in katha ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 32 Jonathan in, “Ipi jeh a kithat ding ham? Aman ipi abolset ham?” tin apa adongin ahi.  
\v 33 Chuin Saul in achapa Jonathan chu tha dingin tengchan akho jengin ahi. Hichea kon chun Jonathan in jong apan David tha ding’a agot mong ahi tichu ahedoh tai.   
\p
\v 34 Hichun Jonathan chu lunghang tah in dokhang a kon'in akipatdoh in, apan ajachat sah behseh jeh chun chuche kut ni-ni lhinni chun an ane tapoi, David chu alungkhampi lheh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Ajing jingkah in David toh akitepna bangin, Jonathan chu chapang khat toh apotdoh in, loujaova chun ache lhontai.  
\v 36 Chuin aman chapangpa jah a chun “ka kapgot thalchang ho hi gaholdoh in,” ati. Chuin chapangpa chu alhaijel in ahile, Jonathan in akal langpeh a thalchang chu akap’in ahi.  
\v 37 Chuin chapangpa chu Jonathan in akapdoh thalchang kom aphah phat ding kon'in, Jonathan in chapangpa jah ah, “Thalchang chu akal langpeh ah achubouve,” atin ahi.  
\v 38 Jonathan'in chapangpa chu asamin, “Hikom'a chun dingden hih in, agang gangin hinchoi loiyin,” ati. Chuin chapangpa chun thalchang ho chu achom khomin, apu henga ahungtai.  
\v 39 Ahinlah chapangpa chun imacha ahepon, Jonathan le David in bou thil kibol ho chu ahet lhon ahi.  
\v 40 Chuin Jonathan in amanchah ho chu chapangpa apen, chenlang khopi sungah ana polut in tin asoltai.   
\p
\v 41 Chuin chapangpa apotdoh doh in, songlhuh pang’a akiselna a kon'in David chu ahung potdoh in, thumveijen tollah amai asulut in Jonathan maiyah akunin, ani lhon'in amitlhi pum'in akikolto lhon'in ana kivailhah lhon tai. Hichu Jonathan sangin David in apona dehset in ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Jonathan in David kom'ah, “Lungmong’in chetan, Pakai min'a thengsel’a ikihahsel lhon nang le kei, na chilhah te le keiya din, ikitepna chu tonsot geiyin Pakaijin eikoi jing uhen,” ati. Hichun David in adalhan, chule Jonathan jong khopi lam’ah akile kittai.   
\c 21  
\s1 David Saul’a Kon'a Ajam  
\p
\v 1 David chu Ahimelech thempupa kimupi din Nob khopi’ah achen ahi. Ahimelech in David chu amu phat in ati akihot in, “Itia na changseh nahi ham? Ipi jeh a mikhat beh in nahin kilhonpi louham?” tin ana dongin ahi. \x + \xo 21:1 \xt Matt 12:3,4; Mk 2:25,26; Lk 6:3\x*   
\p
\v 2 David in adonbut in, “Lengpan kin chomkhat a eihinsol ahi bouve, ipi bol dia kahung hi koimacha hetsahlou dia eihil chah ahin, chule ka sepai te chun katepna mun chom khat a eikimupi diuva ka seipeh ahi,” ati  
\v 3 “Neh le chah ipipi nanei em? Changlhah pheng nga ahilou le nehthei adang ipi um'em neipen,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Hichun thempu pan jong, adonbut in “Keihon changlhah mai-mai kanei pouve. Ahinlah koitobang nailamcha a numeiya kisuboh louho dingin changlhah theng kanei uve,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun David in, “Lungkham hih in, keiman kamite adeh a galsat dinga ache tengu le numeiya konna kikangse louho kaphal jipoi, gamkhol mai-mai kache tengu jongleh hiche thudol’a kisuboh ngailou ahiuve, achutile hiche khohsah tum neiya kholjinna a iti thenda diu ham!” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Neh ding dang aumtah lou jeh in, thempu pan changlhah kithensosa chu David apetai, ajeh chu changlhah Pathen a tosa bou chu anei ahin, hichu athah akitoni tengleh changlhah chu kikhelji ahi. Chule hiche nikho tah a chu athah ana kikoi khel ahi. \x + \xo 21:6 \xt Thempu Dan 24:5-9\x*   
\p
\v 7 Edom mite akon Doeg kiti mipa khat, Saul gancha ching lamkaipu khat anaum khan, Hou-In mun’a bol lhing ding kin aneijeh in ana umden khan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 David in Ahimelech jah a, “Nakom'a tengcha ahilou le chemjam um'em? Lengpa kin’a kigoman louva kahung ahin, manchah ima kahin choilou ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Ahimelech in, “Elah phaicham’a natha pa, Philistine mipa Goliath chemjam bou chu kaneije; hikom'a thempu von kikoina nunglam’a khun pon’in akichun in aum'e, nadei le kilah in, adang vang aumpoi” ati.  
\p Chuin David in ajah a, “Hichu neipen! Chusang’a phajo le hoijo chemjam adang umponte,” ati. \x + \xo 21:9 \xt 1 Samuel 17:51\x*   
\p
\v 10 Hichun David Saul kom'a kon'in ajamdoh in, Gath khopi Achish lengpa heng ajontan ahi.  
\v 11 Ahinlah Achish lenggam sung’a lamkaiho chu akom uva aum ding chu akipah pouvin ahi. \x + \xo 21:11 \xt 1 Samuel 18:7; 29:5\x* Ama hon, “Hiche mipa hi agamsung’a leng changsa David chu hilou haimo? Miho lam uva, ama chung changa hi la asah uva,  
\b  
\q1 Saul in mi asang asangin athat in,  
\q2 David in vang sangsom somin athat e,  
\b  
\p tia alachoi pau chu hilou ham?” tin adong uve.   
\p
\v 12 Hiche athuseiho chu David in ajah phat in Gath lengpa Achish chu akicha lheh jeng tan ahi. \x + \xo 21:12 \xt Labu 56\x*  
\v 13 Hijeh chun David jong aki ngolsah in, kotpi phung dung ho chu ajihpolin, chule akhalhang dunga achilphon akaisah dehduh jengin ahi. \x + \xo 21:13 \xt Labu 34\x*   
\p
\v 14 Achaina in Achish lengpan amite ho kom'ah, “Hitobang mingol chu kaheng'a nahung sah uham?  
\v 15 Kakimvel'a hitobang mingol kanei louva nabol uham? Ipi dinga motchon chon a eisuboi ding bep a ka insung laitah a, kamasang’a hiche pa hin puilut nahiuvam?” tin ahung eojah jengin ahi.   
\c 22  
\s1 Adullam Songko Sung’a David  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun David in Gath adalhan Adullam a songko sungah akisel’in ahi. Asopite le apa insung mite jousen ajah phat un ahengah achesuh un ahi. \x + \xo 22:1 \xt Labu 57; 142\x*  
\v 2 Chuin bol hesoh thoh, aleiba, alung genthei jouse le lunglhai louna jousen David chu ahin bel un ahile amaho chu 400 tobang ahung lhing’un, David chu amaho lamkaiyin apangtan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Chujouvin David Moab gam'a Mizpeh kho ah achen, hia chun aman lengpa jah a, “Pathen'in kachunga ipi abol ding kahet toh masangin, nakom'ah kanu le kapa nangho kom'a achen theina din nei phalpeh in,” tin ngehna aneijin ahi.  
\v 4 Hiti chun David songko sunga aum sungsen, anu le apa chu Moab lengpa kom'ah aum lhon e.   
\p
\v 5 Nikhat Gad themgao pan David kom'a, “Songko sungah umden hih in na umna dalhan lang Judah gam lang’ah chetan,” ati. Hichun David akipatdoh paiyin Hereth gamsung ajon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Judah gamsung ahunglut tai ti thusoh Saul in ana jatan ahi. Hiche pettah a chu Saul lengpa chu Gibeah khoa huisum phung noi khat a ana toupet ahin, akhut a tengcha akichoiya, gal lamkailen ho akimvel’a tou uva ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hiche thusoh ajah phat chun, Saul chun alamkai lenho masang'ah hatah in asamin, “Ngaitem’un Benjamin mite ho! David in na boncha uva lou le lengpilei pedia kitem em? Asepai te lamkaiya pansahna dia kitem em?” ati.  
\v 8 “Hiche ho jeh a hi nang hon keima tha na dia lungthim nanei uham? Ka chapan Jesse chapa toh kitepna anei lhon chun, koima chan seipeh ding neigo pouve, keima dingin jong nei gelkhoh peh pouve. Phaten kingai touvin! Ka chapa tah injong eithana dingin atilkhouvin, eichanglhi le-len, ahinlah koima chan jong nei seipeh pouve,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Chutah chun Doeg kiti Edom mipa chu Saul toh ana ding khom'in, “Keiman Nob a kana umlaiyin Jesse chapa chu ahungin, Ahitub chapa Ahimelech thempupa toh akihoulim lhon jong kamui,” ati. \x + \xo 22:9 \xt 1 Samuel 21:7-9; Labu 52\x*  
\v 10 Chule Ahimelech chun David din Pakai adohpeh in chujongleh neh ding jong aluipeh in, Philistine mihatpa Goliath chemjam jong apei,” ati.   
\s1 Thempu Ho Kitha  
\p
\v 11 Chuin Saul lengpan jong Ahitub chapa Ahimelech le a inkote chule Nob gamsung’a thempu kin bol jouse man dingin mi asoltan ahi.  
\v 12 Aman acheho ahung lhun phat un, Saul’in lunghang tah in, “Ahitub chapa ngaijin! Hichun Ahimelech in jong,  
\p “Lengpa ipi thu hitam?” tin adongin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Saul in, “Ipi jeh a nang le Jesse chapan kei douna a na natoh lhon ham? Ipi jeh a neh ding le chemjam napeh ham? Ipi jeh a ama dinga Pathen kom'a na dohpeh ham? Ipi jeh a kei thana dinga na tilkhou ham? Tua eidouva, kei that dia changpang jing ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Ahimelech in adonbut in, “Ahinlah kapu, nasoh teho lah a hi koi pentah hi natupa David banga kitah um am? David chu na vengtup holah a lamkai hiya chule leng inpi sung’a mitin in aja pentah hilou ham?” ati.  
\v 15 “Ken ama dinga Pathen henga thudoh ka bolpeh hi tuchunga hi apatna jong ahi tapoi. Ahinlah hiche chung changa hin lengpan kei le ka insung mite nei ngoh thei pouvin nate ajeh chu nang douna le thana dia thil kigong ho hi khat a khatcha kahepha poi,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Hiche tah chun lengpan jong Ahimelech jah ah, “Nathi tei-tei ding ahi, nang jong na insung mite jouse jong na boncha uva nathi tei-tei diu ahi,” tin ahohsal tai.  
\v 17 Chule lengpan akom'a ding ama ngah a pang sepai pa jah a chun, “Pakai thempuho hi that gam jengin, ijeh-inem itile, amaho jong hi David toh kikhutjop cheh ahiuve ajeh chu David ajamtai ti ahe sohkeiyun ahinlah eiseipeh pouve!” ati. Ahinlah Saul sepai te ho chun Pakai thempuho tha jeng ding chu akhut alhaang ngam tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hichun lengpan Doeg jah a, “Nangin bol jengin,” atile, Edom mipa Doeg chun hiche nikho chun thempu von a kivon Pakai thempu som get le nga ana that gam’in ahi.  
\v 19 Chuin thempuho chenna Nob ah achen, thempu ho insung mite jouse abon chauvin numei le pasal, chapang le nao noichep lai, bongchal jouse le sangan te, kelngoiho geijin athat gamhel tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Ahin Ahimelech chapa te lah a amin Abiathar kitipa bouseh chu ajamdoh man’in David kom'ah ana jamlut tai.  
\v 21 Saul in Pakai thempu jouse athagam chu Abiathar in David kom'ah aseipeh tai.  
\v 22 Hichun David in jong Abiathar jah ah, “Edom mipa Doeg kamu nia patna chu Saul jah a asei tei-tei ding kahetsa ahitai, keiman napa insung mite aboncha kathilo sah ahitai.  
\v 23 Keima kom'a um'in, kicha hih in, keiman ka hinkho phal ngam in navengbit nange, ajeh chu nangma tha dinga nahol pan keijong tha dinga eihol ahi,” tin aseipeh tan ahi.   
\c 23  
\s1 David In Keilah Khopi Ahuhdoh  
\p
\v 1 Nikhat David heng’ah thu ahung lhungin, Philistine miten Keilah kho abulu uvin, chule changphol'a chang jouse jong akichom gam tauve, ahung tiuve.  
\v 2 David in Pakai kom'a, “Kaga che a kaga sat ding ham?” tia adoh leh  
\p Pakaijin ahin donbut in, “Henge, chenlang Keilah khopi khu ga huhdoh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Ahinlah David sepai ten ajah a, “Ven eiho Judah gamsung jenga jong kichatah a um ihiuvin, i-atileh Keilah khoa icheuva hiche Philistine sepai te khujatpi khutoh ikisattopi thei diu ham?” atiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Hijeh chun David in jong Pakai adongkit in ahile, Pakaijin ajah a, “Keilah ah kumsuh un. Ajeh chu keiman kapanpia Philistine mite najo dingu ahi,” ati.  
\v 5 Hijeh chun David le asepai te jong Keilah khopi ah acheuvin, Philistine te agasat un, mi tamtah agathat tauve, chule agancha jouseu ahin kikai’un chule Keilah kho miho jong ahuhdoh un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ahimelech chapa Abiathar chu Keilah khopia konna ahung jamdoh a David kom ahin jot chun, Thempu von ompho khat ahin kipohlut in ahi.   
\p
\v 7 David chu Keilah kho ah ahung luttai tithu Saul’in ajah phat in, “Apha lheh jenge! Tua vang hi Pathen'in kakhutna apehdoh ahitai, ajeh chu kulpi kaikhumsa, kulpi kikamkhum sung’a David hi ama amacham'a hung vahlut ahitai,” ati.  
\v 8 Hitah chun Saul in asepai te jouse akhom-khom sohkeiyin, Keilah khopi chu ahin nokhum’un, David le asepai te chu aumkhum tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Ahinlah David in Saul thilgon jouse chu ahen, Abiathar thempupa jah ah, “Thempu von ompho chu hikom'ah hinchoiyin,” ati.  
\v 10 Chuin David in, “Vo Pakai Israel Pathen, keima hiche mun'a kaum jeh hin Saul in Keilah khopia hung’a akhopi hi suhchim ding tohgon aneijin ahi.  
\v 11 Hiche kho mite hin keima hi amaho khutna eipehdoh diu ham? Chule Saul hung mong ding hinam? Vo Pakai Israel Pathen, lungsettah in nei seipeh in,” tin ataovin ahi.  
\p Chuin Pakaijin,“Hung ding ahi,” tin adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 12 David in jong, “Keilah khopia lamkaiho hin, keima le ka sepai te hi Saul khutna eipeh doh dingu ham?” tin adong kit in ahi.  
\p Chule Pakaijin, “Henge ama hon na pehdoh dingu ahi,” tin ahin donbut in ahi.   
\s1 David Thinglhang’a Akisel  
\p
\v 13 David le amite chu 600 vel alhin phat un, Keilah mun chu adalha uvin thinglhang lang’ah apotdoh ule David chu ajamdoh tai ti thu chu Saul lengpan ajahdoh phat in Keilah khopi lam chu anajon tapoi.  
\v 14 David vang chu gamthip lah ah munthip khat ah aumin, Ziph gamthip thinglhang gamlah achun apansa dentai.   
\p
\v 15 Nikhat chu Horesh kom vella David aum pet in, Saul chun David tha ding hollin Ziph lam ahin jon touve tithu ajatan ahi.  
\v 16 Hichun Jonathan in jong David kimupia Pathen tahsan tah a dingdet kheh dingin atilkhou dingin ahol in ahi.  
\v 17 Jonathan’in, “Kicha hih in, kapan na mudoh jou ponte! Nangma Israel te leng nahung hi ding ahi, keima kapa banga nang ban a kahi ding ahi, hichu kapa Saul in ahet ahi,” tin ana tilkhouvin ahi.  
\v 18 Hijeh chun amanin Pakai masang ah kitepna khat anei lhon'in ahi. Chuin Jonathan ain lamah akilen, David vang chu Horesh mun ah aumden tai. \x + \xo 23:18 \xt 1 Samuel 18:3\x*   
\p
\v 19 Chujouvin Ziph miho chu Gibeah mun'a Saul hengah acheuvin, David chu apedoh tauvin ahi. “Keihon akiselna mun kaheuve. Ama tuhin Jeshimon lhanglam’a um Hakilah thinglhang gamsung Horesh kulpi dunga keiho lah a David kisel ahi,” atiuvin ahi. \x + \xo 23:19 \xt Labu 54\x*  
\v 20 “Vo lengpa nakigot chaiya nakigin phat-phat a nahung konsuh a ahile keiho jaonan na panpi uving ting, David chu nangma khut a pedoh nauvinge,” aga tiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun Saul in jong, “Pakaijin phatthei naboh uhen, ajeh chu nang hon hibangtah in keima ding neihin gelkhoh peh uve.  
\v 22 Cheloiyun lang, phate chan gaphochen un, aumna mun, agena mun, gahechen set uvin lang gavechil chet tauvin, ajeh chu, ama hi mi kilep themtah ahi.  
\v 23 Hijeh chun akiselna mun hoilai ham ti, gavechil sohkei uvin ima jouse he sohkei uvin lang, kaheng'a hungkit uvin, chutengleh keijong nangho toh kilhon a icheuva agamsunga David aumpou pouva ahileh ka holdoh tei-tei ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 24 Hijeh chun amaho jong akipatdoh uvin Ziph gam langa chun Saul sang'in ana che masa tauve.  
\p David le asepai te chu hiche pet a hi Jeshimon lhanglam a Arabah gamsung Maon gammang noiya kisel’ah ahiuve.  
\v 25 Saul le amiten ahol'e leuve ti David in ajahdoh phat in, gamthip sunglam agamla jep songpi lentah khat sungah alut in Maon gamthip ah aum tan ahi. Ahinlah Saul chun ana hol jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Chuin Saul le amite molpang langkhat ah achen, hibangma chun David le aloiho jong molpang lang khat ah acheuvin, chuin Saul le aloiho chun, David le amite chu nailutna mat din aumkol tauvin ahi.  
\v 27 Ahin Saul heng ah thusoh kin khat ahung lhungin, ajah ah, “Gangtah in hungin ajeh chu Philistine ten gamsung gal ahin bol tauve,” tin ahung seijun ahi.  
\v 28 Hijeh chun David nung adella kon'in Saul akinunglen, Philistine te sat din achetai. Hijeh chun hiche mun chu Kiselna Songpi asah tauvin ahi.  
\v 29 Chuin David chua kon chun ache touvin En-gedi mun dettah sunga achengtai.   
\c 24  
\s1 David In Saul Hinkho Ahinghoi  
\p
\v 1 Saul in Philistine mite agasat a ahung kile jouvin, En-gedi gamthip mun’ah David aluttai tithu aseipeh tauvin ahi.  
\v 2 Hijeh chun Saul in Israel mite jousea kon'in galsat them cheh mi 3,000 akilhen doh in David le amite hol dingin gam kelcha umna songkol lang’ah aga hol tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Saul chu ahunga ahile lampia kelngoi honlah khat agatoh khan, hiche laiya chun songkohom khat aumin, hikom'a chu chomkhat kicholdo din aluttai, hiche songko sunga adan sungnung lang ma-ma a chu David le aloite kisel ahiuve! \x + \xo 24:3 \xt Labu 57; 142\x*   
\p
\v 4 David loihon ajah a guhthimin, “Tuhi nang dia phat kijen petcha ahi! Tunia hi Pakaijin asei, ‘Keiman na melma pa chu nakhut a kapeh doh a, nangman na phatsah lam-lam'a nabol ding ahi’ tia asei nikho chu tunia hi hunglhunga ahitai,” atiuve. Hijeh chun David jong akipatdoh in, kangchan akithol thol’in, Saul sangkhol chol mong chu aga attan peh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Ahin David in Saul sangkhol chol mong chu aga attan chu alungsunga nommo asan ahi.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun amite jah a, “Pakaijin ahet ahi, hiche hi kana bollou ding dol ahi, ajeh chu amahi ka pakai le kaleng ahi. Pakaijin adeilou, ka pakai le ka lengpa chunga hiche kabol hi alhendohsa le athaonu doudal kahi,” atin ahi. \x + \xo 24:6 \xt 1 Samuel 26:11\x*  
\v 7 Hijeh chun David in a sepai te chu atuhtang nah-nah in, Saul chu atha sah tapon ahi.  
\p Saul athouvin songko adalhah a, alampia akiche phat in,  
\v 8 David ahung potdoh in anung ajuijin asamin, “Ka pakai le lengpa!” atileh Saul ahung kihei phat in ama jabolnan David tol’a abohkhup in chibai aboh in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Chuin hitin Saul jah a asamin, “Ipi bolla nangin mipi ho thusei na ngaiya, keihin nang chu kasuh genthei dan a nagel ham?  
\v 10 Tuni nikho tah jeng’a jong nangman namit tah in namun ahi, hichu atahbeh ahi. Ajeh chu Pakaijin kei khotona noiyah songko sung jenga jong nakoijin ahi. Kamite ho phabep khat in katha ding hitam tia eidoh uva kana noplou ahi. Ipi jeh inem itileh, ‘Keiman ka lengpa sugenthei louding kahi. Ama hi Pakai thaonu sa ahi,’  
\v 11 Ven, kapa, kakhutna ipi kachoi em? Na sangkholchol among kachelhah chu bou kachoi ahi bouve! Nathat pong kate. Nas ugenthei pong kate ti vetsahna a keiman nangma kasuh genthei louding chule nangin tha dingin nei del le-le jong lechun na chunga ka chonset louding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 12 “Pathen chu eini kah a ahetoh, athutan ahi. Ijem tia kei chunga nabolla ahile Pathen'in gotna napeh ding ahi, ahinlah ken vang nang kasuh genthei louding ahi.  
\v 13 Thuchih lui khat in, ‘Miphalou hoa kon'in, thil phalou tohdoh in aum'e,’ ati. Hijeh chun nang douna a itih chan hijongleh kakhut kalap louding ahi.  
\v 14 Israel lengpa chu koipen nunga hung hija, koipen thu nung nahin dal mong-mong ham? Uicha thisa khat tou ham, uili khattou nung del nahim? \x + \xo 24:14 \xt 1 Samuel 26:20\x*  
\v 15 Hijeh chun Pakai chu thutanin pang henlang, kei le nang kikah a thutan pa hijing jeng hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Chuin David in aseiding jouse asei jou phat in Saul in ahin donbut in, “Thu hin sei a chu chapa David mong-mong nahi hinam?” atin akap pan tan ahi.  
\v 17 Chule David kom'a aseijin, “Nang hi kei sangin nadih e, ajeh chu keiman na chunga thil phalou jeng kabollin ahin nangman vang thilpha jengin nei lethuh jing jenge,” atitai.  
\v 18 “Henge, nangman hepina dihtah in tunin nei ngailun, nei tha theina ding laitah a jong neithat pon ahi.  
\v 19 Hitobang hi mihem khat in amelma pa ato khah a ahile damsel a alhadoh mong-mong ding hinam? Hijeh chun tunia kei dinga thilpha na boldoh jeh in Pakaijin thilpha na bolpeh tei-tei hen.  
\v 20 Chule tun keiman kichen tah in kahetai, nangma Israel te leng nahung hitei tei ding ahi.  
\v 21 Hijeh chun tunin Pakai minin kaheng'a kitem'in, ‘Kathi nung le ka insung jong na hinghoiya, ka khanggui le ka chilhah jong nei hoipeh teijin!” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Chuin David jong Saul kom'a akihahsel in, hichun Saul jong inlam ajon tan; David le asepai chengse akulpiu mun'a akaltou tauvin ahi.   
\c 25  
\s1 Samuel Thi  
\p
\v 1 Tun Samuel athi tan ahile Israel mite jouse avui dingin ahung kikhom un, athilong chu a-op uvin, Ramah khoa a-inah avui tauvin ahi.  
\s1 Nabal In David Asuh Lunghang  
\p Hichun David chu Maon gamthip ah akumsuh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Maon a kon nei le gou tampi neiyah mihaothei tah khat Carmel khopia kiveina bol mi khat aum'in ahi. Ama chun kelngoi sang 3,000 chule kelcha 1,000 aneijin ahi chule hiche phatlai chu kelmulvo phatlai ahi.  
\v 3 Hiche mipa min chu Nabal akitin, ajinu min chu Abigail akitin ahi. Ajinu chu numei chingtah ahin, thil umdan hekhen themtah jong ahin, amel jong mel-hoi tah ahi. Ajipa vang chu Caleb phungmi, umdan, chondan helou mi ahin, giloutah a chon jeng ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nabal kitipa hin kelngoi avah e tihi David in ahedoh tan ahi.  
\v 5 Hijeh chun David in gollhang somkhat asolin Nabal henga thuthot le salam gabol din asol in ahi.  
\v 6 Hichun gollhangho chun, “Chamna le khantouna nang le na insunga chule nanei le nanga chengse chunga umhen!” atiuvin ahi.  
\v 7 “Nangman kelngoi mulvou ding miho chu keiho Carmel kom'a nakoiye ti kajan, keihon suh gentheina ima kanei pouve chule amahoa kon'in jong ima guh le lah kanei pouve.  
\v 8 Namite ho dong jong le chun adihtah chu naseipeh nauvinte. Golvah nikho khat le kahung diu ahin, kipah tah a neisan diu David in adeiye. Lungset tah in napeh thei-thei neipeuvin, na lhacha keiho le nagol ngaitah keima David min'in,” ati.  
\v 9 David gollhangho chun David minin hicheng chu Nabal henga alhut uvin chule ama hon Nabal donbutna angah uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Nabal in jong noise tah in, “David kitipa chu koi hija ham? Hiche Jesse chapa hi ama le ama ipia kigel ham? Tulaiya hi soh tamtah apakai teu henga konna jammang atam e.  
\v 11 Achutile, iti keiman ka kelngoi mulvou a pangho ka thapeh kelngoisa, a twidon ding u chule aneh diu ka changlhah jouse hi kalahpeh a, kahet phahlou gam'a hungkon miho chu kapeh beh ding hija ham?” atipeh tai.   
\p
\v 12 Hichun David gollhangho chu ahung kinungle uvin, Nabal in asei jouse chu David heng’ah alhut tauvin ahi.  
\v 13 Chuin David in, “Na chemjam kigot un!” atin, hichun mi 400 toh akilhon’un, chule mi 200 anunglam uva thilkeo ngah din adalha uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun Nabal soh ho lah a mi khat in Abigail aga hetsah in, “David in gamthip gam'a kon'in gollhangho kapu kom'a salam boldin asol'in ahileh ana phohsal in ahi.  
\v 15 Gollhang ho chu keiho dinga phatah ahiuve, keihon amahoa kon'in hahsatna imacha katoh khapouve, kaum khom sung uvin jong keihoa kon'in imacha alahdoh ujong aumpoi.   
\p
\v 16 Sun le janin keiho leh kelngoiho dingin baang bangin eihong jingun, eingah tup jing uve.  
\v 17 Hiche thu ho hi nangman nahet chet angaiye chule ipi bolding ham ti nagel angaiye, ajeh chu ka pakai pa le a insung mite jousea ding’a thil hahsa hungsoh dingin akilom e. Ama la alungtong lheh in koimacha to kihou thei ahipoi,” ati.  
\v 18 Hichun Abigail in gangtah in changlhah lhon 200 akigot in, lengpitwi savun peng ni dimset agongin, honminsa kelngoi nga akigot in, changpoh kana atena dim nga agon, lengpithei changlhah boh 100 toh, theichang changlhah a kisem 200, hciheng hi, amanun sangan chungah asemin,  
\v 19 asohte jah ah, “Ana che masauvin, keiman kahin juipai ding nahiuve,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Abigail chu asangan chunga atouvin molchunga akal touvin, aman David le amite ama langa ahung chu amun ahi.  
\v 21 David in, “Hiche Nabal kitipa gancha jouse chu keiman khatcha beh jong manthah sah louva gammang noija kachinpeh chu panna beija kabol dan ahitai, tun Nabal in ka thilpha bol jouse thilsen eihin lethoh pehtai.  
\v 22 Jingkah teng Nabal mi ahi kiti tapou pasal khatna khat jeng cha jong hinghoi louva ka thagam louva ahile, Pakaijin keima David hi eithat jeng hen,” tin aseitai.   
\s1 Nabal Dia Abigail Taona  
\p
\v 23 Abigail in David amu phat in, asangan chunga kon'in akumlhan amasang ah akunin abohkhup in jana apen ahi.  
\v 24 Akengphang bul’a abohkhup in ajah a, “ka pakai, thilsoh hicheng ho hi keima themmona ahi jenge, chule nahenga kasei hi, nei ngaipeh in.  
\v 25 Hiche Nabal hi milungtong le mipha ahipoi, thupitah in lahih in, ajeh chu ama hi mingol ahi bouve amin tobang banga ama jong hija ahi. Ahinla kapun nahinsol gollhangho chu nasoh nun kana mulou ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 26 “Tujengin jong Pakai hingjing min'a kasei ahi, kapu jong nahin laihin Pakaijin thisanso a themmo sahna ding jousea na hoidoh sah ahitan, nakhut tah a phu nalah ding jong aphallousa ahitai, hijeh chun suhset ding tha dinga nahol a na melmate jouse chu Nabal tobang hisohkei uhen.  
\v 27 Na sohnu keiman hiche nangma le na gollhang ho neh le chah dia kahin poh hi kapu nei sanpeh tei-teijin.  
\v 28 Na sohnu hi ipi hile ka themmona aum leh abonchan nei ngaidam in. Pakai dia galsat nahi jeh in Pakaijin nang le na chilhah te lenga natung jing uhen chule na hinkho lhumkeijin thilse bolda jengin,” ati.   
\p
\v 29 “Midang hon na that dingin hung kipat uhenlang, nahol hol jeng jongleu, kapu na hinkho hi Pakai na Pathen'in nei le gou manlutah bangin naveng tup jingin ahi. Ahin na melma te jouse gophel a songchang kikap mang bang’a akap mang ding ahi.  
\v 30 Chujongleh na chung chang thudol'a Pakaijin aseisa jouse chu kapu dinga na bolpeh sohkeiya, Israel chunga lenga natun tengleh,  
\v 31 hitobang ho hi nolnabei nahina chu kipuisetsah hih in. Chutile ajeh beiya mitha jeh ham ahilou le nangin naphu nakilah jeh ham a nalung gimpi louding ahi. Chuleh Pakaijin kapu nangma chung’a phatecha a na inchen sah tengleh, na sohnu keijong neihin geldoh tei teiyin,” ati.   
\p
\v 32 David in Abigail adonbut in, “Tunia Israel Pathen'in keito kimuto dinga nahinsol jeh in, Pakai chu thangvah in umhen!  
\v 33 Thil nahet them jeh in Pathen thangvah in umhen! Nangma jong phatthei chang in, ajeh chun nangman tuni hin kathemmona ding thisan kaso a kei le kei phulahna a kakhut kalapna dinga kon'in nei huhdoh tai.  
\v 34 Pakai Israel Pathen min a kasei ahi, Pakaijin nangho eisuhsetda sah ahitai, neihung kimupi loi hih le chun jing khovah masang’a Nabal mite khat a khatcha kahinghoi louding ka thagam hel diu ahitai,” ati.  
\v 35 Hichun David in jong athilpeh chengse akisan in, chule amanu jah ah, “Lungmong tah in na inlam'a chetan, keiman na thusei kangai peh in, na inneipu jong katha louding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 36 Hiti chun Abigail ahung kilekit a ain agalhun phat in, Nabal chun a insungah lengpa golvah ni bangin kut ana bollin ahi. Ama chu ju hakham in akhamin, hijeh chun amanun jong ajing jingkah chan geijin David toh akimuto thu jong aseipeh tapoi.  
\v 37 Jingkah khovah lhah a Nabal jong ajukhamna a konna ahung limdoh phat in, ajinun thilsoh umchan jouse chu abonchan aseipeh tan ahileh atija behseh jengin, alungsunga alung achat tapon, ajalkhun a songtum bangin akitung dentai.  
\v 38 Nisom jouvin, Pakaijin Nabal chu adengin, athipai tan ahi.   
\s1 Daivd In Abigail Akichenpi  
\p
\v 39 David in Nabal thi ajah phat in, “Pakai thangvah in umhen, Nabal khutna konna jumsona hiche Nabal chunga phu eilahpeh chu nunnom hen. Nabal in achonset man akisan ahitai,” ati. Chuin David in Abigail henga aji hina dingin thuthot aneijin, agadoh sah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 40 Chuin thupole ho chu Carmel alhun phat un, Abigail jah a, “David in jia nei dia, nang puiya eihinsol’u ahi,” aga tiuve.   
\p
\v 41 Hichun Abigail chu tol’ah abohkhup in hitin adonbut in, “Kei, nasohnu, David toh kakichen ding kakipah e, alhacha hiya akeng soppeh dia gotsa kahi,” ati.  
\v 42 Abigail jong lungkin tah in akigongin, akipatdoh pai paiyin, sangan chung khat a akaldoh in ama jenlea pangji asoh numei nga chu akipuiyin, David sohte nung ajuijin, David ji dingin apangtai.  
\v 43 David chun Jezreel kho mi Ahinoam jong akichenpin, anigel lhon'in ajidin apang lhontai.  
\v 44 Hiche kahlah chun Saul chun achanu Michal kitinu, David jinu chu Gallim kho mi Palti chapa Laish chu aji din apetai. \x + \xo 25:44 \xt 2 Samuel 3:14-16\x*   
\c 26  
\s1 David In Saul Avel'a Ahinghoi Kit  
\p
\v 1 Mi phabep Ziph a kon'in Saul kimupi dingin Gibeah mun ah ahung’un, “David chu Jeshimon nisolam'a Hakilah mol chunga chu kisel ahi,” ahung tiuve. \x + \xo 26:1 \xt Labu 54\x*   
\p
\v 2 Hijeh chun Saul in galsat them cheh Israel sepai 3,000 akipuiyin David hol dingin Ziph gammang lam ajonsuh tauvin ahi.  
\v 3 Saul chun Jeshimon nisolam'a Hakilah molchung lamlen panga David kiselna mun’a chun ngahmun akisemin ahi. Ahin David chun Saul in gammang noiyah ahung hol'e ti ahedoh tan ahi.  
\v 4 Saul chu ahung mong nai ti photoh dingin guhthim in mi asol'in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Jankhat David chu Saul umna ngahmun chu kholchil'in ache in, aven ahileh, Saul, Ner chapa Abner chule a sepai jalamkai chu asung'ah alum'un, sepaiho chun akollin akimvel'ah akigolun un ahi.  
\v 6 Chuin David in Hit mipa Ahimelech chule Zeruiah chapa Joab sopipa Abishai jah a, “Saul ngahmun lailunga khu koipentah in kipedoh a ei kilhonpi ding ham?” tia adoh a ahile  
\p Abishai in, “ Keiman nakilhonpi nange,” tin ahin donbut in ahi.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun David le Abishai chu Saul umna ngahmun sung’ah alut lhon'in ana imut pettah u agatoh lhon'in, ngahmun lailunga chun Saul alumin, alukhap kom'a chun atengcha tolla ana kiphut in, chule Abner le asepai te chu Saul kimvel'ah ana imu uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Abishai in David kom'a onemtah in, “Tunia hi Pathen'in namelma pa nangma khutna na pehdoh ahitai; keiman ama hi nivei sut ngai louvin khatvei seh-seh sun ingting leitoh sutbeh tange!” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Ahin David in, “Bollou ding ahi. Natha louding ahi. Pakai thaonusa douna a akhut lam tapou chu koimacha athemmo louding aumpoi,” tin ana phoh in ahi.  
\v 10 “ Hingjing Pathen min'a kasei ahi, nikhat tengleh Pathen'in Saul hinjep nemtei nante, ahilouleh tehthi nante ahilouleh gal’a thi ding ahi.  
\v 11 Pathen thaonu khat katha ding chu Pakaijin ajah nompoi! Ahinlah atengcha le alukhap kom'a atwipai vang kilah in, chuteng hia kon'in dalha hitin cheta hite!” ati. \x + \xo 26:11 \xt 1 Samuel 24:6\x*   
\p
\v 12 Hijeh chun David in tengcha le Saul alu kom'a twipai chu alan chule ama le Abishai chu koimacha hetlou kah in achemang lhon tai, ajeh chu Pakaijin Saul mite alhim imut ngoideh sah ahi.   
\p
\v 13 David angahmun gallang’u mol’ah akal touvin akiven phahna chan agei lhon'in ahi.  
\v 14 Sepai ho leh Ner chapa Abner jah din, “Abner, kithouvin!” tin ahin samin ahile “Koi nahim?” tin Abner in adonbut in adongin ahi.  
\v 15 David in, “Aphai, Abner, nangma milen, nahilou ong? Nang hi pasal nahi hilou ham? Israel lah a hi nang tobang mimo koi umkha am? Ipi dinga nangman napu lengpa chu phatecha nahontup lou ham?  
\v 16 Hiche hi phaloubeh ahi! Pakai hingjing min'a kasei ahi, nang le lengpa athisa tobang nahi lhontai, ajeh chu nangman na pakai pa naventup jou tahlou jeh in na losamtai. Na pakai, na leng, Pakai thaonu atengcha le alulhuna atwipai jong phaten koitup peh tangem?” tin ahin samin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Saul in David ogin ahi chu ahen, “Ka chapa David chu nahilou haimo?” ahin tin ahile David in adonbut in, “Henge ka pakai le lengpa.  
\v 18 Ibola ba nei chanle le ham? Ipi kabolset em? Kathepmona ipi ham?  
\v 19 Ahin tun ka pakai le ka lengpa nasohpa thusei hi ngaiyin, Pakaijin kei douna a natildoh ahi vang leh ka maicham eisan peh hen. Achuti louva mihem tildoh mai-mai ahivang leh, ajao tapou Pakaiya kon'in gaosap changhen. Ajeh chu ama hon ka inmun'a kon'in eidel mangui. Hijeh chun Pakai mite toh kaum khom thei tapoi, chule gamchom mite pathen houtan eitiuve.  
\v 20 Pathen’a konna gamla tah a gamdang mite ho gamsunga kathi ding hitam? Ipi jeh a chu Israel lengpa chu uili khat hollea hung kipatdoh ham? Ipi jeh a kei hi molsang vum'a lhanlha adel banga eidel jeng ham?” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Chuin Saul in, “Keiman kabol khel tai. Inlam’ah hung kile tan, kachapa, keiman tukal nasugim taponge, tunin ka hinkho hi nei hinghoi peh kittai. Keima angol tobang chule suhkhelna tamtah kana neitai,” tin Saul in ahin donbut e.   
\p
\v 22 David in, “Vo lengpa, hichea hin na tengcha aum'e. Khangdong mikhat hinsol inlang hung la hen.  
\v 23 Pakaijin midih le kitahna neiho dungjuijin kipaman apejin ahi. Tunin jong Pakaijin nangma chu kei khutna eipehsa ahitan, hijongleh keiman Pakai thaonusa lengpa chunga kakhut kalap louhel ding ahi.  
\v 24 Ven tunia keima mitmua nangma hinkho manlutah kahisah bang chun keima hinkho jong Pakai mitmun manlutah hijeng henlang, Pakaijin thoh hahsa kathohna changsea kon'in eihuhdoh tei-tei hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 25 Chuphat in Saul jong chun David jah a, “Ka chapa David nunnom in! Nang hin thil tamtah nahin bol ding chule na lolhin tei ding ahi,” ati. Hichun David jong ajotna ding langa akichen, Saul jong akho lama ahung kile kit tan ahi.   
\c 27  
\s1 Philistine Te Lah’a David  
\p
\v 1 Ahinlah David ama le ama akingaiton, “Nikhat leh Saul in tha tei ding eigot ahitai. Kabol thei pentah chu ahile Philistine gam'a jamdoh ing ting, Chutileh, Saul in Israel gamsunga eidal le le hi bei tante chuteng hichu kahoidoh na achaina hitante,” ati.  
\v 2 Hichun David in a sepai mi jagup akipuijin, Gath lengpa Moach chapa Achish ajoptai. David le a sepai te, chule a insung mite, Gath mun'a Achish toh acheng khom tauve.  
\v 3 David chu aji teni, Ahinoam Jezreel a kon, chule Abigail, Nabal inneipi meithai Carmel’a kon hotoh hungkhom ahiuve.  
\v 4 Saul in adel jamle le theilou nadingin David Gath lengpa kom'ah ajamlut tai tithu chu Saul in gangtah in ana jatan ahi.  
\v 5 Nikhat David in Achish kom'ah, “Kachunga nalung alhaiya, nalungsetna kachanthei dinga ahile, hiche kholen ho lah a hin kachenna thei ding mun khat neipen, ajeh chu ipi dinga nasohpa hi hiche lengpa khopi sunga nang toh kachen khom khom thei ding ham?” ati.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun Achish in hiche nikho chun Ziklag khopi chu David anape tai, hijeh a chu tuni chan geija Ziklag khopi hi Juda lengte chang den ahitai.  
\v 7 Chule amaho Philistine mite lah a kum khat le lha li ana chenguve.  
\v 8 David le a sepai te ana kon touvun Geshur mite le Girzi mite chule Amalek mite aga chom uvin ahi. Hiche mite ho hi Shur toh kinai, Egypt mite gamsunga ana chenglui ahi tauve.  
\v 9 David in ana nokhum chun koimacha ana hinghoi pon ahi. Aman kelngoi, kelcha, bong, sangan, sa-ngong sao ana kikaiyin, chule ponho analan, Achish lengpa kom ana lhut in ahi.  
\v 10 Achish in, “Tuchung koipen naga chom hitam?” tin anadongin ahile David in, “Juda gam lhanglam sang, Jerahmeel gamsung, Ken mite chenna gamsung dung pou kaga chom ahi,” ati.  
\v 11 David chun koimacha numei pasal khen beiyin ana thatgam jin, ama le amite natoh dol chu Gath khoa gaseidoh ding aumjipoi. Philistine miho lah a aum sunga, avel vella hiche hi abol jing kei ahi.  
\v 12 Achish chun David chu atahsan jeh chun, “Tuvang hin Israel miten David hi hatah in doudal tauvin tin, kakom'a uma a imatih chana kakin abol ding hita hi,” tin ana gel’e.   
\c 28  
\s1 Saul’in Gaochangnu Phun Asansah  
\p
\v 1 Phat chomkhat jouvin Philistine miten gamsunga a sepai jouse akhom un, Israel mite toh kisat dingin akigo tauve. Achish lengpan David jah ah, “Nang le na sepai ten galsatna a neipan khompi diu ginchat aum'e,” ati.   
\p
\v 2 David jong anom in, “Apha lheh jenge! Ichan kabol thei dol natahsa tah a namu ding ahi,” ati.  
\p Chuti chun Achish in David jah ah, “Keiman keima hinkho eivengtup dia kasem ding nahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 \x + \xo 28:3 \xt Thempu Dan 20:27; Danbu Ni Na 18:10,11\x*Samuel athi phat in, Israel pumpin alhaset piuvin, along a-op uvin, ama khopi sung ma-ma Ramah ah avuitauvin ahi. Chule Saul in agamsunga gaochang jouse le phunsan ho athisa ho lhagao ho toh kihoutoh ho jouse anomang tan ahi. \x + \xo 28:3 \xt 1 Samuel 25:1\x*   
\p
\v 4 Philistine te akikou khom’un, Shunem ah ngahmun asauvin chule Saul in Israel sepai jouse akhomin Gilboa ah ngahmun asemin ahi.  
\v 5 Saul in Philistine sepai tamtah amu phat in akicha behseh jengin alungthim alinglao lheh jeng tan ahi.  
\v 6 Hichun aman, ipi kabol ding hitam tin Pakai adongin, ahinlah Pakaijin adonbut tapoi, mang hihenlang, phunsan hihen chule themgao hijongleh iman adonbut tapoi. \x + \xo 28:6 \xt Minbu 27:21\x*  
\v 7 Chuin Saul in athumop a pang ho asol’in, “Cheuvin lang gaochang numei nei gaholpeh un, keima chengting amanu chu kagadoh ding ahi,” ati.  
\p Hiti chun athumop a pang ho khat in, “Endor mun'ah gaochang numei khat aum'e,” ahin atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Saul in athempu von chol akhellin von mai-mai in akivon in, jan in sepai mini akipuijin numeinu in'a chun acheuvin ahi.  
\p Chuin aman, “Keiman athisa mi khat kakihoupi nom e, a lhagao neikou peh thei dem?” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Numeinu chun, “Nangman tha dinga neigot ham? Saul in gamsunga konna gaochang jouse le phunsan them jouse adelmang hi nahet ding ahi. Chutia ahileh nangman ipi dinga keima kipalsah tei ding neigot ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Ahinlah Saul chu Pakai min panin akihahsel'in akitemin ahi. “Tahbeh a hingjing Pakai min'a kasei ahi, hiche nabol jeh hin ima thilse um ponte,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Achainan numeinun jong, “Aphai, koi pentah lhagao ka koudoh peh ding ham?” atile  
\p Saul in, “Samuel lhagao nei koudoh peh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Numeinun Samuel amu phat in, ahung pengjah jengin, “Nangman nei joulhep e, nangma Saul nahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Hichun Lengpan amanu kom'ah, “Kicha hih in, koi namum?” atile amanun jong,  
\p “Pathen khat kamun leisetna kon'in ahung potdoh e,” ahin ti.   
\p
\v 14 Saul in, “Amapa chu koitoh kilou em?  
\p Ama chu tehsepu ahin, sangkhol chol khat akiah e,” ati. Saul in Samuel ahi ahechen tan, chuin amasanga tol’ah abohkhup in chibai abohtai.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun Samuel in, “Ipi jeh a neisuh boiya, neinung kou ham?” Chuin Saul in, “Ajeh chu keima kaboina asanglheh tai, Philistine te galsat din ahung kigo uvin, Pathen'in eidalha tan, themgao ahilou le mangin jong eihetsah tapoi. Hijeh a chu nang kahin doh ahi, Ipi kati ding hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Ahinla Samuel in adonbut in, “Pathen'in na dalhah tah a, chule agalmi nahitah a ahile, ibol'a kei neidoh ham?” ati.  
\v 17 “Pathen'in asei banga abol ahitai. Na lenggam nanga konna ale lah a chule David joh apeh ahitai. \x + \xo 28:17 \xt 1 Samuel 15:28\x*  
\v 18 Pakai thupeh jouse napalkeh a, alungnatna na boldoh a, Amalek mite le anei jouseu na suhmang hel lou jeh a tua hi Pakaijin hitia abol ahitai. \x + \xo 28:18 \xt 1 Samuel 15:3-9\x*  
\v 19 Chule jing nikho tengleh nang le na sepai ho jouse Philistine te khut a apehdoh ding ahitai, chule nangma le na chapa kaheng’a hung ding nahi lhon tai. Israel sepai te jong Pakaijin Philistine te khut a pedoh tante,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Samuel thucheng seiho atijat behseh jeng jeh in, Saul chu tol’ah akijam den jengin ahi. Sun le jan’a an nelouva aum jeh in, agil akel'in alhalhop jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Numeinu chea agavet le, atijat val chu amudoh in, “Kapu, nei lungset in kenbon kahinkho phalngam’a neidoh ho kanop a kabolpeh ngam nahi.  
\v 22 Tun nangman jong kasei bangin bollin, neh ding phabep kapeh ding nahin, nenlang natha kidodoh sah kit in,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Ahinlah Saul chun ima neh ding anompoi. Chule avaipo teho geiyin nehsah tei ding agouvin, akhon-khon nan anomin tol’a kon'in ahung kithoudoh in jalkhun chung’a atousah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Hiche numeinu hin a ina bongnou thaochet khat anei ahin, hichu agathat loiyin, changbong toh ameh nangjet in, chol solouvin changlhah akangtan ahi.  
\v 25 Chuin changlhah le bongsa chu Saul le aloi teni chu athuh peh in ahile ama hon ane tauve. Aneh jou phat un hiche jan chun amaho ahung kile kit tauve.   
\c 29  
\s1 Philistine Ten David Apaidoh U  
\p
\v 1 Muntin'a Philistine sepaiho Aphek a akikhom khom’un, chule Israel te sepai chu Jezreel twinah phung mun’ah akikhom uve.  
\v 2 Philistine lamkai hon asepai te jakhat loi, sangkhat loijin akhen'un alamkaiyun, David chule a sepai te Achish lengpa kom langa akijot un ahi.  
\v 3 Ahinlah Philistine gal lamkai hon, “Hebrew mite ho hiche a hi ipi bolla hiuvem?” atiuve.  
\p Chuin Achish in, “Hiche pa hi David, Israel mite lengpa Saul sohpa chu ahi. Ama hi akum kum’a keitoh umkhom kahi lhon'in, ahunglhun nia kipat tuni chan geiyin athepmona imacha kamupoi,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Ahinla Philistine lamkaiho chu alunghang un, “Na khopi pehna achun nungsol tan! Ama keiho toh galsat in konkhom thei pouvinte, ama galsatna mun’ah kilehei henlang Philistine mite eihin le sat kit uhenlang, eiho luchang hijatpi hi kipoh henlang apupa toh kicham kit taleh, hiche tilouva aman thilpha abolthei ding adang ipi uma na ngaitom?” atiuvin ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche David kitipa hi hilou ham? Mihon la abol uva,  
\b  
\q1 ‘Saul in mi asang asang athat in,  
\q2 David in mi sangsom som in athat’e, tia kisei chu?” atiuve. \x + \xo 29:5 \xt 1 Samuel 18:7; 21:11\x*   
\b  
\p
\v 6 Hichun Achish lengpan achaina in akouvin David jah ah, “Pakai hingjing min'a kasei ahi, nangma keidin nakitah lheh jengin ahi. Keima gellin nang toh gal'a ikon khom ding ham kanati ahin. Ajeh chu nahung lhun tilla kipat in tuni chan geijin na suhkhel imacha kamupon ahi. Ahivanginla Philistine lamkai len dang hon nangma toh gal isat khom diu hi, anom pouvin ahi.  
\v 7 Lungset tah in achung uva lung nommo louvin, lungmong in inlam'a kile kit tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun David in, “Ipi kanabol khel'a hitobang thil soh ham? Na sohpa keima chunga hi ipi lunglhai louna na mudoh a ka pakai le ka lengpa toh, galmi ho kasat khom theilou hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Ahinlah Achish in, “Keima tah mudol in, nangma hi Pakai vantil bangin nadih lheh jenge, ahinlah Philistine gal lamkai hon gal nasat khompi ding akichauvin ahi.  
\v 10 Hijeh chun, jingkah matah tengleh kithou vinlang namite ho jouse toh nei dalha tauvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Hiti chun David le aloite ho akigong’un, Philistine gamsung adalha tauvin ahi. Hiche phat chun Philistine sepai hon Jezreel ajon tauvin ahi.   
\c 30  
\s1 David In Amalek Mite Asuhmang  
\p
\v 1 Nithum jouvin, David le aloite ain’u Ziklag khopi agalhun phat un, Amalek miten Negev chule Ziklag ana sat uva, Ziklag khopi chu meiya ana halvam’u agatoh khauvin ahi.  
\v 2 Mihem khatcha that louvin, numei le chapang geiyin ana kaimang uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Chuin David le amihon thilsoh le akisuh chimit chu amu uva chule thilsoh ho amu phat uvin,  
\v 4 amaho hakan akap un, acholdeh chan geiyin akap un ahi.  
\v 5 David jiteni, Jezreel a konna Ahinoam chule Carmel a konna Nabal meithai, Abigail, teni jong chu akaimang lah uva chu jaotha ah ahi. \x + \xo 30:5 \xt 1 Samuel 25:42,43\x*  
\v 6 Hijeh chun, David jong alung himo behseh jengtan ahi, ajeh chu amite ho ji le chate ho jong ana kaimangu ahi. Ahinlah David in Pathen a kon'in thahatna akimu ben ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hijeh chun Abiathar in thempupa jah a, “Thempu von ompho chu neihin choipeh in,” ati. Hijeh chun Abiathar in hichu ahinchoi peh in ahi. \x + \xo 30:7 \xt 1 Samuel 22:20-23\x*  
\v 8 Chuin David in jong Pakai adongin, “Hiche Amalek mite hi anung’u del leng kaphah ding hinam?” atileh  
\p Pakaijin ahin donbut in, “Henge, dellin, akaimangsa jouse jong nanung mukit ding ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hijeh chun David in mi 600 akigot in, Besor vadung ahungpha tauve.  
\v 10 Sepai 200 vang chu Besor vadung agalkai ding’u chu alel behseh jeh uchun, David chun amoh cheng mi 400 toh adeltou peh uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ache uva ahile gamlah ah Egypt mite khat amandoh uvin David henga ahin kailut tauve. Ama hon neh ding changlhah phabep chule adon ding twi apeuvin ahi.  
\v 12 Chule theichangga a kisem changlhah lhon jong apeuvin aneh a adon jou phat in atha ahung hatdoh tan ahi. Ajeh chu an nelou twidon louva nithum le janthum jen kelthoh a um ana hitai.   
\p
\v 13 Chuin David in, “Hoiya hungkon nahia, koimi nahim” tia adoh le,  
\p “Keima Egypt mi gollhang kahin, Amalek mikhat soh kahi, nithum masanga pat a chu damlou kahi, ka dammo a kipat a ka pakai pan eidalhah ahitai.  
\v 14 Judah gamsung a Kereth mite gamsung’a Negev khopi, Caleb phung mite gamsung ka chomun, chule Ziklag khopi chu meiya ka hallhah uva hung kile kahiuve,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun David in, “Hiche michom ho kom'a chu nei puilut thei ding ham?” tia adoh leh gollhang pan, “Keima neitha da a, chule kapu henga nei pehdoh kit louding’a, Pathen min’a nakihahsel leh keiman napui nange,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Hijeh chun David chu apuijin ahile ama hon Amalek mite ho chun Philistine gamsung le Judah gamsung’a konna achomdoh thilkeo simsen lou kipapina a golnop abol uva, muntin'a akithe thang uva, aneh pet u, adon pet u chule alam pet u atohkha tauvin ahi.  
\v 17 Chuti chun David le amiten anokhum un, jan khovah keiyin Amalek mite chu athat un ajing nilhum keiyin nilhangkai chan geiyin athat jingun ahi. Gollhang mi 400 sangong sang chunga touva ajamdoh ho tilou adangse vang athat sohhel'un ahi.  
\v 18 Amalek miten alahpeh jouseu chu David in abonchan a inneipi teni jaonan anung lahpeh kittai.  
\v 19 Imacha jong amangthah den aumpoi, aneo alen, chapa ahilou le chanu, abonchan akinung mu kittai.  
\v 20 David chun kelngoi hon le bonghon jouse jong abonchan anung lahpeh kit in, amiten ahin hoilut soh tauve. Hichun ama hon, “Hiche hi David in gal’a achomdoh ho ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 21 Chuin David chu chol behseh jeh a Besor vadunga kidalha sepai jani heng’a achen, David le aloi adang ho amu phat uvin ahung potdoh uvin, kipah le thanom tah in ahung lamto uvin ahi.  
\v 22 Ahin David mite lah a miphalou boina sem jeng mi phabep khat ho chun, “Hiche eiho toh kilhon khomlou ho hin hiche thilkeo kichomdoh hohi kilah thei pouvinte,” ahin tiuve.   
\p
\v 23 Ahinlah David in, “Ahipoi, kasopi teho, hiche thilkeo chunga hin kilosepou hite. Aman damsel'a eiven uva, galte eijosah uva, ijakaija eikithopiu ahi.  
\v 24 Eihon hitia hi thu isei uleh kon nasei angai ding ham? Galkonpa chan jat chu thil ngahpa jong chang tei ding ahi,” tin ahin donbut in ahi.  
\v 25 Hiche nia kipan chun David in chonna ding dan ana sem in, tuni geiyin Israel sunga chonna dan in akimangtai.   
\p
\v 26 Ziklag ahunglhun phat in, gal’a kihomdoh thilkeo phabep chu aloi agol Judaho athot in hitin aseiye, “Hiche thilpeh hi nangho ding ahi, Pakai dougal teho a kon ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 27 Athilkeo athot ho chu anoiya khomite ding hi ahi: Bethel, Ramoth-negev, Jattir,  
\v 28 Aroer, Siphmoth, Eshtermoa,  
\v 29 Jerah’meel mite khopi Racal, Ken mite khopi dung’a chengte,  
\v 30 Hormah, Bor-ashan, Athach,  
\v 31 Hebron chujongleh David le asepai te toh akilonna muntinna athot sohkei uvin ahi.   
\c 31  
\s1 Saul Le Achapa Thi  
\p
\v 1 Philistine miten Israel mite chu anokhum tauvin ahile, Israel mite chu Philistine te masanga ajam cheh uvin, Gilboa molsanga aken laiya chun Philistine ten athatgam tauve.  
\v 2 Philistine miten Saul le achapa teho jong adelphapa uvin, achapa thum Jonathan, Abinadab, chule Malkishua jong athat tauve.  
\v 3 Saul panmun kimvel’a jong gal akihasat lheh jengun, akhonna in thalpi kapthem hon akapkha un, melsetah in amavo uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Chuin Saul in agalvon popa jah ah, “Na chemjam satdoh inlang nei that in hiche Philistine Pathen helou ho ahung uva eimoh sutlih sangun,” ati.  
\p Ahinla agalvon popa akichan athat ngampon ahi. Chuin Saul in jong ama chemjam asatdoh in, achemjam chu abokhum in ama le ama akithat tai.  
\v 5 Chuin agalvon popan Saul athitai ti ahetdoh phat in achemjam asatdoh in alhuh khum in alengpa kom'ah ama jong athi tan ahi.  
\v 6 Hiti chun Saul, achapa thumho, chule agalvon popa, abonchauvin nikhat sungin athi sohhel tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Jezreel phaicham agal langkhat, Jordan vadung niso lam’a Israel ten, Israel sepai teho agaljam gam tauve tithu ajahdoh uva, Saul le achapa te ho jong athat tauve ti ajah phat un, akhopi hou adalha uvin ahile Philistine mite akhopi sung uva alut un akhopiu chu alo tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Ajing nikho in Philistine miten mithilong ho hetup dinga ahung uleh Gilboa Mol chunga Saul le achapa te thumho le agalvon popa, alongu ahung mudoh un ahi.  
\v 9 Chuin Saul alu atan uvin agalvon chengtoh apotauve. Saul thi jeh in Philistine gamsung jouse le a pathen hounau hou-in’ah kipa thuphon aneiyun ahi.  
\v 10 Saul galvon chu amilim doi ahounau Ashteroth kiti hou-in sung'ah akoijun chule atahsa chu Beth-shan kiti khopi sunga bang ah akhaiyun ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ahinlah Jabesh-gilead miten jong Philistine miten Saul abolnau ajah phat un,  
\v 12 Gal-hang pasal jouse akipatdoh un, ahung kitol’un, jan khovah hellin Beth-shan a kon'in Saul le achapa teho long chu banga kon'in ala lhauvin, Jabesh khopi ah ahin pulut un hikom'a chun ahalvam un ahi.  
\v 13 Chujouvin agu ho chu alauvin Jabesh khoa tamarisk thingphung noiyah avui uvin, chule nisagi jen apuldou nan an angol uvin ahi.   